hadiths[293]{hadithnumber,text}:
"3899","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”sfr azab ka ayk tkra hay jw aadmy ky nynd، khanay awr pynay say mhrwm hw jata hay، lhza jb wh apna mqsd pwra kr lay jhan wh gya tha، asay chahyay kh apnay ghr walwn kay pas jldy kray۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3900","abdallh by۔ jafr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm sfr kay bad tshryf layay tw aap sly allh alyh wslm kay ghr kay bchay mlay۔ ayk mrtbh jb wh sfr kay bad phnchay tw sb say phlay myn an say mla awr as nay mjhay apnay samnay atha lya۔ phr fatmh kay dw bytwn myn say ayk kw sath laya gya awr asay apnay pychhay bthaya awr hm tynwn kw ayk janwr pr mdynh laya gya۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3901","ans nay byan kya kh wh awr abw tlhh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay sath phnchay jn kay pychhay sfyh rzy allh anha swar thyn۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"3902","anhwn nay kha kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm rat kw apnay ghr walwn kay pas nhyn aatay thay blkh sbh ya sham kw dakhl hwnay kay aady thay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3903","jabr rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb tm myn say kwyy zyadh dyr tk ghr say bahr hw tw wh rat kw apnay ghr walwn kay pas nh aayay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3904","anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt ky hay kh aap nay frmaya: ”jb tm rat kw phnchw tw apnay ghr walwn kay pas as wqt tk nh jana jb tk kh wh awrt js ka shwhr chla gya hw apnay aap kw saf nh kr lay awr pragndh awrt knghy nh kray۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3905","anhwn nay btaya kh jb nby sly allh alyh wslm mdynh tshryf layay tw aap nay ayk awnt ya gayay kw zbh kya۔ kha jata hay kh snt ka tqaza hay kh jw sfr say waps aayay wh aysy tfryh mhya kray jw as kay wsayl myn hw۔ agr rwayt myn \ya\"" ka astamal transmytr ky trf say as shk ky nshandhy nhyn krta hay kh kwn sa lfz shyh hay، blkh ayk hqyqy mtbadl hay، tw as say yh nzryh drst hw jayay ga kh rwayt nby sly allh alyh wslm kay aml ky bat krty hay۔ lykn arby sakht waqay ayk mwqa ky trf asharh krty hay bjayay as kay kh nby sly allh alyh wslm kay mdynh tshryf layay۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"""""
"3906","kab b۔ malk rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh nby sly allh alyh wslm sfr say srf dn kay wqt dwphr myn tshryf latay thay، awr jb aap sly allh alyh wslm phnchay tw sb say phlay msjd myn tshryf lay gyay jhan aap nay dw rkat nmaz ada ky، as kay bad aap sly allh alyh wslm as myn byth kr lwgwn kw hazryn dya۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3907","jabr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh myn ayk sfr myn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay sath tha، jb hm mdynh phnchay tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay mjh say frmaya: ”msjd myn dakhl hw jao awr as myn dw rkatyn prhw۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"3908","skhr b۔ wdaa alghamdy nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt ky hay kh \aay allh myry amt kw an ky sbh myn brkt ata frma۔\"" jb as nay kwyy dsth ya lshkr rwanh kya tw dn kay shrwa myn bhyj dya۔ skhr ayk tajr tha، awr wh dn kay shrwa myn apna saman bhyj dyta tha۔ awr wh amyr hw gya awr as kay pas bht dwlt thy۔ asay trmzy، abwdaod awr darmy nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"3909","ans rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”rat kw sfr krtay rhw، kywnkh zmyn rat kw [zyadh aasany say] gzr jaty hay۔ * lfzy twr pr 'zmyn jwr dy gyy hay۔' khyal yh hay kh rat kw sfr chhwta lgta hay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"3910","amrw by۔ shayb nay apnay wald ky snd say byan kya kh an kay dada nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt ky hay kh \ayk swar shytan hay awr swarwn ka jwra shytanwn ka jwra hay، lykn tyn swarwn ky jmaat hyn۔\"" asay malk، trmzy، abwdaod awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"3911","abw sayd khdry rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb tyn sfr myn hwn tw an myn say ayk kw apna sph salar mqrr kr lyna chahyay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"3912","abn abas rzy allh anhma say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: shabh ky sb say achhy tadad char hay، sb say achhy tadad char sw ky hay، awr sb say achhy tadad char hzar hay، awr barh hzar tadad ky kmy say ghalb nhyn aayyn gay۔ asay trmzy، abwdaod awr darmy nay rwayt kya hay، trmzy khtay hyn kh yh ghryb rwayt hay۔"
"3913","jabr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm sfr myn pychhay rh jatay thay awr kmzwrwn kw trghyb dytay thay۔ wh ksy kw apnay pychhay lay jata awr an sb kay lyay daa krta۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"3914","abw salbh khshny khtay hyn kh jb lwg prao daltay thay tw wh dhknwn awr wadywn myn bkhr jatay thay، lykn jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”tmhara an dhknwn awr wadywn myn phylna srf shytan ka hay، tw as kay bad jb anhwn nay prao dala tw as hd tk qryb hw gyay kh kha jata tha kh agr ayk kpra an pr phyla dya jayay tw wh sb pr chha jayay ga۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"3915","abdallh by۔ msawd rzy allh anh nay kha: bdr ky lrayy myn hm myn say hr tyn aadmywn kay pas ayk awnt tha۔ abw lbabh awr aly bn۔ abw talb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay sathy thay awr jb aap sly allh alyh wslm kay atrnay ky bary aaty tw aap sly allh alyh wslm ky bjayay pydl chlnay ky pyshksh krtay، lykn aap sly allh alyh wslm frmatay: tm mjh say zyadh taqtwr nhyn hw، awr myn tm say zyadh ajr dynay pr qadr nhyn hwn۔ *yany rastay pr chlnay ka agly dnya myn ajr۔ yh shrh alsn myn mntql hwty hay۔"
"3916","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”apnay janwrwn ky pythwn kw mnbr nh smjhw، kywnkh allh taalyٰ nay anhyn tmharay taba kya hay takh wh tmhyn as bsty tk phncha day jhan tk tm bghyr dshwary kay nhyn phnch sktay، awr as nay tmharay lyay zmyn kw mqrr kya hay، lhza asy pr apna karwbar krw۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"3917","ans rzy allh anh nay kha: jb hm nay prao dala tw hm nay allh ky tsbyh nhyn ky yhan tk kh hm zynwn kw khwl dyn۔ * as ky wzaht nmaz ada krnay kay many kay twr pr ky gyy hay۔ sy ayf mrqat، iv، 218۔ asay abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"3918","brydh rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm chl rhay thay kh ayk aadmy aap kay pas aaya js kay pas ayk gdha tha awr as nay janwr ky psht pr chrh kr asay swar hwnay ky dawt dy، lykn aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: nhyn، tmhyn apnay janwr pr aagay swar hwnay ka zyadh hq hay jb tk kh tm mjhay yh hq nh dw۔ as aadmy nay jwab dya kh as nay aysa kya، awr wh swar hw gya۔ asay trmzy awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"3919","sayd by۔ abw hnd nay byan kya kh abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”awnt shyatyn kay hyn awr ghr shyatyn kay hyn۔ as nay kha kh as nay shytanwn kay awnt dykhay hyn۔ kwyy shkhs achhy awntnyan lay kr nklta hay jnhyn as nay mwta kya hwta hay، nh an myn say ksy pr swar hwta hay awr nh hy ksy thkay hwyay bhayy kw js say wh mlta hay asay lft dyta hay، lykn as nay shytanwn kay ghr nhyn dykhay thay۔ sayd khta tha kh as kay khyal myn yh wh pnjray hyn jw lwgwn kw brwkyd say chhpatay hyn۔ 1. aam twr pr yh khyal kya jata hay kh as say mrad abwhryrh hyn۔ 2. ayk mkhtlf prhnay myn 'jw lwgwn nay chhpaya' hay۔ pnjrwn ka mtlb hay awntwn ky pyth pr kwra۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"3920","shl by۔ maaz rzy allh anh nay apnay wald say rwayt ky kh hm nby sly allh alyh wslm kay sath ayk mhm pr gyay awr lwgwn nay atny jgh ghyr ly kh anhwn nay rastay myn ghs lya، tw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay ayk aadmy kw bhyja kh lwgwn myn yh aalan kr day kh jw lwg zyadh jgh pr qbzh krtay hyn ya rastay myn tjawz krtay hyn wh jhad myn shmar nhyn hwtay۔ * as say mrad wh wqt hay jb wh dyray dal rhay thay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"3921","sydna jabr rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”aadmy kay lyay sfr say wapsy pr apnay ghr walwn kay pas janay ka bhtryn wqt rat ka shrwa hay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"3922","abw qtadh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm jb rat kw sfr myn prao daltay tw apnay dayyn trf lyt jatay awr jb sbh say thwra phlay prao krtay tw apna bazw atha kr apna sr apny hthyly pr rkhtay۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3923","abn abas rzy allh anhma khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay abdallh bn msawd rzy allh anh kw bhyja۔ rwahh ayk latalqy kay sath awr wh jmah kay dn hwa tha۔ as kay sathy sbh kw rwanh hwyay، lykn as nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay sath nmaz prhnay kay bad pychhay rhnay ka fyslh kya۔ jb as nay aysa kya tw as nay asay dykha awr as say pwchha kh sbh kw apnay sathywn kay sath nklnay say ks chyz nay rwka؟ as nay jwab dya، \myn aap kay sath nmaz prhna chahta hwn awr phr an kay sath mlna chahta hwn،\"" as pr aap nay frmaya، \""agr aap tmam zmyn pr hsh dalyn gay tw aap kw sbh kay wqt an kay nklnay ky fzylt hasl nhyn hwgy۔\"" asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"""""
"3924","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”frshtay as sfr kay sath nhyn jatay js myn pyntr ky khal hw۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"3925","shl by۔ sad rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”sfr myn lwgwn ka rb an ka khadm hwta hay awr jw an ky khdmt myn aagay brhta hay wh shhadt kay swa ksy aml ky wjh say an pr sbqt nhyn rkhta۔ * as ka mtlb yh hay kh ya tw lydr kw apnay pyrwkarwn kay mfadat ka khyal rkhna chahyay، ya yh kh sb say aajz rkn jw dwsrwn ky khdmt krta hay asay khda ky trf say anaam dya jata hay gwya wh swdagr hay۔ byhqy nay asay shab alayman myn nql kya hay۔"
"3926","abn abas rzy allh anhma nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay qysr kw aslam ky dawt dynay kay lyay kht lkha۔ as nay dhyh alklby kw apna kht as kay pas bhyja awr asay hkm dya kh wh asay bsrh kay gwrnr kay hwalay kr day takh wh qysr tk phncha day۔ as kay mndrjat yh thay: khda kay nam say، jw rhm krnay wala، rhm krnay wala hay۔ mhmd، khda kay bnday awr rswl say lay kr bazntynywn kay srdar hyraql 1 tk۔ slamty hw hdayt ky pyrwy krnay walwn pr۔ aagay brhnay kay lyay: myn aap kw aslam qbwl krnay kay lyay smn bhyjta hwn۔ agr tm aslam qbwl krw gay tw tm mhfwz rhw gay، awr agr tm aslam qbwl krw gay tw khda tmhyn dwgna ajr day ga۔ lykn agr tm rwgrdany krw gay tw tm apnay pyrwkarwn kay gnah kay mrtkb hw gay۔ 2 \ahl ktab ayk aysy bat ky trf aao jw hmaray awr tmharay drmyan mshtrk hay kh hm srf allh ky abadt kryn، as kay sath ksy kw shryk nh thhrayyn، awr allh kay swa ayk dwsray kw rb nh bnayyn، lykn agr wh mnh mwryn tw khh dw kh gwahy dw kh hm mslman hyn۔\"" 3۔ 2. arysy ka mtlb hay mty ka jwty، lykn yhan aam lwgwn kay lyay aam hwalh kay twr pr astamal kya gya hay jw as ky msal pr aml kryn gay۔ 3. alqraan 3:64. (bkhary w mslm۔) mslm kay ayk nskhay myn \""mhmd khda kay rswl ky trf say\""، \""al yrysyyn ka gnah\"" awr bayat alaslam hay۔"""""
"3927","anhwn nay btaya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay apna kht ksryٰ kay pas abdallh bn msawd rzy allh anh kay pas bhyja tha۔ hzyfh shmy nay asay hkm dya kh wh asay bhryn kay gwrnr kay hwalay kr day۔ bhryn kay gwrnr nay asay ksryٰ tk phnchaya awr jb as nay asay prha tw as nay asay phar dya۔ abn almsyb nay kha kh phr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay an pr lant bhyjy takh wh tkray tkray kr dyn۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"3928","Anas (Radi Allahu Anhu) ne bayan kiya ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne Kisra (Iran ke badshah), Qaisar (Rome ke badshah) aur Najashi (Habsha ke badshah) aur har zabardast hukmaran ko khat likhey, unhein Allah ki taraf bulaya. (Yahan Najashi se muraad woh Najashi nahi jo hijrat ke waqt tha). Muslim ne isay riwayat kiya."
"3929","slyman by brydh nay apnay wald kay hwalay say btaya kh jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay ksy lshkr ya dstay ka kmandr mqrr kya tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay anhyn hdayt ky kh wh khwd khda say dryn awr apnay sath mwjwd mslmanwn ky bhlayy ka khyal rkhyn۔ phr frmaya kh khda ka nam lay kr khda ky rah myn nklw awr kafrwn say lrw، nklw awr mal ghnymt myn khyant nh krw، nh khyant krw، nh ksy kw qtl krw، awr nh ksy bchay kw qtl krw، jb tm mshrkwn say mlw jw tmharay dshmn hyn، an kw tyn batwn ky trf blao، awr an myn say jw chahw qbwl krw awr agr wh qbwl krna chahyn tw aslam qbwl krlw*۔ wh an say as kw qbwl krtay hyn awr an say ajtnab krtay hyn، phr anhyn apnay thkanay chhwrnay awr hjrt krnay walwn kay thkanay myn mntql krnay kay lyay blayyn، awr anhyn btayyn kh agr wh aysa krtay hyn tw an kay bhy why hqwq awr zmh daryan hwn gy jw mhajryn kay pas hwn gy، lykn agr wh an say ankar kryn gay tw wh an shrayy arbwn ky trh hwn gay jw mslman hyn، lykn an ka kwyy akhtyar nhyn hay۔ mal ghnymt jb tk kh wh an say jzyh ka mtalbh krnay say ankar kr dyn، lykn agr wh ankar kr dyn tw khda say mdd tlb kryn awr an say lryn، jb aap ksy qlaay awr as kay lwg an kw khda awr as kay pyghmbr ky hfazt ky zmant dyn، tw yh aap ky hfazt awr thfz ky zmant nhyn hay۔ agr aap ksy qlaay kw twrnay kay lyay srmayh lgatay hyn awr as kay lwg as kw tslym krtay hyn awr maamlh khda kay dayrh akhtyar myn bhyj dytay hyn، tw as ky ajazt nh dyn، blkh anhyn tslym kr lyn awr maamlh aap kay dayrh akhtyar kay hwalay kr dyn، kywnkh aap nhyn jantay kh aap an kay baray myn khda kay dayrh akhtyar pr hmlh kryn gay ya nhyn۔ *as kay bad jw kchh awpr byan kya gya hay wh tyn chyzwn kw tfsyl say byan krta hay۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3930","abdallh by۔ abw awfy nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay apny ayk jng myn dshmn say mlaqat ky jb tk swrj dwb gya tw aap lwgwn kay drmyan khray hwyay awr frmaya: tm lwg dshmn say mlnay ky tmna nh krw blkh allh say aafyt mangw awr jb an say mlw tw sbr krw awr jan lw kh jnt tlwarwn kay sayay myn hay۔ as kay bad as nay kha: aay khda، jw ktab nazl krta hay، badlwn kw sfr krta hay awr athadywn kw chlata hay، an kw shkst dyta hay awr hmyn an pr fth ata krta hay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3931","ans rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm hmyn ksy qwm kay khlaf jhad pr nklay tw sbh tk hmaray sath nhyn nklay۔ wh an ky trf dykhta awr agr azan ky aawaz snta tw an say rk jata، lykn agr wh nh snta tw an pr hmlh kr dyta۔ hm khybr ky trf nklay awr rat kw an kay pas phnchay lykn jb sbh hwyy awr azan nh sny tw wh swar hw gya۔ myn abw tlhh kay pychhay swar hwa awr myra paon rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw chhw rha tha، wh apny bry twkryan awr kwdalyn lay kr hmaray pas aayay awr jb anhwn nay nby sly allh alyh wslm kw dykha tw khnay lgay: \mhmd، khda ky qsm، mhmd awr lshkr ky\"" awr qlah ky trf pnah lynay chlay gyay۔ jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay anhyn dykha tw frmaya: \""allh sb say bra hay، allh sb say bra hay، khybr gr gya hay۔ 1 jb hm ksy qwm kay shn myn atrtay hyn tw yh an lwgwn kay lyay bry sbh hwty hay jnhyn khbrdar kya gya tha۔\"" 2 1. ya، 'khybr gr jayay۔ 2. Cf. alqraan؛ 37:177۔ (bkhary w mslm)"""""
"3932","alnaman b۔ mqrn nay kha kh wh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay sath lrayy myn mwjwd tha، awr jb dn kay shrwa myn aap sly allh alyh wslm nay jng nhyn ky tw aap as wqt tk antzar krtay rhay jb tk hwayyn nh chlyn awr nmaz ka wqt aa gya۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"3933","alnaman b۔ mqrn nay kha kh wh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay sath lrayy myn mwjwd thay، awr jb dn kay shrwa myn wh lrtay nhyn thay tw swrj ghrwb hwnay tk antzar krtay thay، hwayyn chlty thyn awr mdd nychay aaty thy۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"3934","qtadh nay naman bn ka hwalh dya hay۔ mqrn khtay hyn: myn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay sath ayk ghzwh myn gya، jb fjr hwyy tw swrj tlwa hwnay tk antzar kya awr jb tlwa hwa tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay jng ky۔ phr jb dwphr hwyy tw swrj ghrwb hwnay tk rk gya awr jb aysa hw gya tw dwphr tk lra، jb zhr ky nmaz prhnay tk rka، phr lra۔ qtadh nay byan kya kh kha jata tha kh as wqt fth ky hwayyn chlty thyn awr mwmnyn nmaz myn apnay lshkrwn kay lyay daayyn krtay thay۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"3935","aslam almzany khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay hmyn ayk dsth bna kr bhyja awr frmaya kh jb tm msjd dykhw ya mozn snw tw ksy kw qtl nh krw۔ asay trmzy awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"3936","abw wayl nay kha kh khald bn alwlyd nay ahl fars kw lkha: khda kay nam say jw mhrban awr rhm krnay wala hay۔ khald bn say۔ alwlyd ta rstm awr myhan fars kay ryyswn myn say۔ slamty hw hdayt ky pyrwy krnay walwn pr۔ aagay brhnay kay lyay: hm aap kw aslam ky trf blatay hyn، lykn agr aap ankar krtay hyn tw aajzy mhsws krtay hwyay jzyh ada kryn (Cf. Al-Quran, 9:29)۔ agr aap aysa krnay say ankar krtay hyn tw myray sath aysay lwg hyn jw khda ky rah myn maray janay kw psnd krtay hyn jysay farsy shrab kw psnd krtay hyn۔ slamty hw hdayt ky pyrwy krnay walwn pr۔ yh shrh alsn myn mntql hwty hay۔"
"3937","jabr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh ayk shkhs nay jng ahd myn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say kha kh agr myn mara jaon tw mjhay btao kh myn khan rhwn ga، awr jb aap nay jwab dya kh myn jnt myn hwn ga tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay apnay hath myn mwjwd kchh khjwryn phynk dyn awr aap sly allh alyh wslm kay qtl hwnay tk lrtay rhay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3938","kab b malk rzy allh anh nay kha: jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ksy mhm pr janay ka aradh krtay tw aap hmyshh as mhm tk khyn awr janay ka bhanh krtay، yany tbwk tk۔ khda kay rswl nay asay skht grmy myn، ayk twyl sfr، shrayy mlk awr bay shmar dshmnwn ka samna kya۔ as nay mslmanwn pr wazh kr dya kh wh kya krnay ja rhay hyn takh wh apny mhm kay lyay saz w saman tyar kr lyn awr anhyn bta dyn kh wh khan ja rha hay۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"3939","jabr rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: jng dhwkh hay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3940","ans rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ksy mhm pr gyay tw aap nay am slym rzy allh anha kw sath lya awr aap sly allh alyh wslm kay pas ansar myn say kchh awrtyn thyn jw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay sfr pr pany playa awr zkhmywn ky dykh bhal ky۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3941","am atyh rzy allh anha khty hyn kh myn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay sath sat sfrwn myn gyy awr saman ky dykh bhal، an kay lyay khana tyar krnay، zkhmywn ky ayadt awr bymarwn ky dykh bhal kay lyay pychhay rh gyy۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3942","abdallh by۔ amr rzy allh anh nay kha kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay awrtwn awr bchwn kw qtl krnay say mna frmaya hay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3943","sab b۔ jthamh nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say an mshrkwn kay baray myn pwchha gya jn ky bstywn pr rat kay wqt hmlh kya gya tha jb an ky kchh awrtwn awr awladwn kw mara gya tha، tw anhwn nay jwab dya kh yh an ky tadad myn say hyn۔ ayk nskhh yh hay kh anhyn apnay waldyn ky trh smjha jata tha۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3944","abn amr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay bn nzyr kay khjwr kay drkht kat kr jla dyay۔ as pr hsn khtay hyn: by lwyy kay bzrgwn nay albwayrh myn wsya pymanay pr phyly hwyy aag kw hlka smjha۔ as kay baray myn jw atra، ’’tm nay jw khjwr kay drkht katay ya apny jrwn pr khray chhwr dyay، wh khda kay hkm say tha‘‘ (alqraan 59:5)۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3945","abdallh by۔ awn nay kha kh nafa nay anhyn yh btanay kay lyay lkha kh abn amr nay anhyn btaya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay bn almstlq pr hmlh kya hay jw almrysy myn an kay awntwn pr hmlh kr rhay hyn۔ *abn ashaq khtay hyn kh yh ghzwh shaban 6 hjry myn hwa tha، lykn as pr swal kya gya hay kh mrysy، bn almstlq ka aabayy alaqh tha۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3946","abw asyd rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay anhyn bdr ky lrayy myn frmaya jb wh qrysh say mlnay kay lyay qtar myn khray hwyay awr wh an say mlnay kay lyay qtar myn khray hwyay kh jb wh qryb aayyn tw tm an pr tyr marw۔ ayk wrzhn hay، \jb wh qryb aatay hyn tw aap an pr gwly chlatay hyn، lykn apnay tmam tyrwn ka astamal nh kryn۔\"" bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"""""
"3947","abdalrhmn by۔ awf nay byan kya kh bdr myn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay rat kw jng kay lyay lys kya tha۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"3948","almhlb nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: \agr dshmn rat kw tm pr hmlh kray tw tmhary fryad h mym hw jayay، an ky mdd nhyn ky jayay gy۔\""* * yh alfaz swrh 41 say lyay ja sktay hyn js ka aaghaz h mym say hay۔ dwsray alfaz as swrh ky aayt nmbr 16 myn hyn۔ sy ayf 44:41۔ asay trmzy awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"3949","smwra by۔ jndb nay kha kh mhajryn ky jng ky aawaz abdallh awr mddgar abdalrhmn thy۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"3950","slamh by۔ akw khtay hyn: hm rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay zmanay myn abwbkr rzy allh anh kay sath ayk mhm pr gyay thay۔ hm nay rat kw dshmn pr hmlh kya awr anhyn mar dala، awr as rat hmary jng ka narh tha \marw marw۔\"" abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"""""
"3951","qys b۔ abyd rzy allh anh nay kha kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay ashab lrayy kay dwran chykhna napsnd krtay thay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"3952","smwra by۔ jndb rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”mshrk bwrhwn kw qtl kr dw، lykn an kay shrkh yany an kay bchwn kw chhwr dw“، asay trmzy awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"3953","arwh nay kha kh asamh nay an say kha kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay anhyn sbh kay wqt abna pr hmlh krnay awr as jgh kw jlanay ka hkm dya۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"3954","abw asyd rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay ghzwh bdr kay mwqa pr frmaya: jb wh qryb aayyn tw tm an pr gwly chlana، lykn apny tlwaryn as wqt tk mt khynchw jb tk kh wh tmharay qryb nh hwn۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"3955","rbah b۔ rbya khtay hyn kh jb hm rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay sath ayk ghzwh myn thay tw aap nay dykha kh kchh lwg ksy chyz pr akthay hwyay hyn awr ayk aadmy kw bhyja js say kha kh yh dykhay kh yh lwg ks chyz kay grd jma hyn۔ jb as nay aakr btaya kh wh ayk awrt kay ardgrd hyn jw mary gyy hay tw as nay kha kh yh wh nhyn hay js say lrayy hwny chahyay thy۔ khald by۔ alwlyd wyn ka ancharj tha، as lyay as nay ayk aadmy kw bhyja kh asay khay kh wh ksy awrt ya mzdwr kw qtl nh kray۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"3956","ans rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”allh ka nam lay kr، allh pr bhrwsh krtay hwyay، awr rswl allh kay dyn pr qaym rhw، ksy kmzwr bwrhay ya chhwtay bchay ya awrt kw qtl nh krw، mal ghnymt myn khyant nh krw، blkh apna mal ghnymt jma krw، nyky krw، kywnkh allh nyky krnay walwn say mhbt krta hay۔ alqraan؛ 2: 195; 5:13۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"3957","aly rzy allh anh nay kha: bdr atbh ky lrayy myn۔ rbyah apnay bytay awr bhayy kay pychhay aagay aayay awr pkara، \kwn akyly lrayy myn hsh lay ga؟\"" mddgarwn kay kchh nwjwanwn nay as ky pkar pr lbyk kha lykn jb as nay an say pwchha kh wh kwn hyn tw anhwn nay btaya kh mjhay aap say kwyy faydh nhyn hay، mjhay apnay wald ky trf say srf apnay chcha zad bhayy chahyay۔ phr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: hmzh athw، aly athw، abydh bn hars athw۔ hmzh atbh ky trf brhay، myn shybh ky trf brha، awr abydh awr wlyd kay drmyan dw war kay bad ayk dwsray kw shdyd zkhmy kr dya۔ chnanchh hm wlyd kay khlaf hw gyay awr jb hm asay qtl kr chkay tw abydh kw lay gyay۔ asay ahmd awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"3958","abn amr rzy allh anhma khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay hmyn ayk dsth kay sath bhyja awr lwg chkr lgatay hwyay bhagay، phr jb hm mdynh phnchay tw yh swch kr as myn chhp gyay kh hm khrab hw gyay hyn، phr hm rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas gyay awr btaya kh hm bhagnay walay hyn، lykn aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”nhyn، tm wh hw jw lrnay kay lyay waps aa rhay hw، jsm myn phywn kay pychhay bhagay hwyay thay۔ hlak hw gya۔\ an ka khyal tha kh anhwn nay aran bhr kr sngyn gnah kya hay۔ 2. yhan lfz fya astamal hwa hay۔ tjwyz yh hay kh aqb myn taynat ksy ywnt myn shaml hwnay kay lyay pychhay htna dshmn ky trf say prwaz nhyn hay۔ sy ayf alqraan؛ 8:16. asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔ abwdaod ka nskhh bhy kchh aysa hy hay۔ as nay kha، \""nhyn، tm why hw jw bhagnay kay bad lrnay kay lyay lwttay hw۔\"" as kay bad hm nay an kay hath kw bwsh dya awr frmaya: myn mslmanwn ka mrkzy adarh hwn۔"""""
"3959","thwbn by۔ yzyd nay btaya kh nby sly allh alyh wslm nay tayf kay lwgwn pr hmlh krtay wqt bylsth qaym kya۔ trmzy nay asay mrsl ky swrt myn nql kya hay۔"
"3960","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”allh an lwgwn pr khwsh hay jw znjyrwn myn jkr kr jnt myn dakhl hwn gay۔ *as ky wzaht as many kay twr pr ky gyy hay kh ghyr mslm jw qydy bna kr aslam qbwl krtay hyn۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"3961","slamh by۔ alakw nay kha: mshrkyn ka ayk jasws jw nby sly allh alyh wslm kay pas as wqt aaya jb aap sfr myn thay apnay sathywn kay sath byth kr batyn krtay rhay awr phr pychhay ht gyay۔ phr nby sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”asay tlash krw awr asay qtl krw“ tw myn nay asay qtl kr dya awr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay as say lwta hwa mal mjhay dya۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3962","anhwn nay kha: hm rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay sath hwazn kay khlaf mhm pr nklay، awr hm rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay sath dwphr kay wqt khana kha rhay thay kh ayk shkhs srkh awnt pr swar hwa، as nay ghtnay tyknay kay bad adhr adhr dykhnay lga۔ ab hm kmzwr halt myn thay awr pharwn kay hwalay say khrab halt myn thay awr hm myn say kchh pydl thay۔ wh jldy say bahr nkla awr apnay awnt kay pas aakr asay chla gya awr wh tyzy say as kay sath chla gya۔ myn jldy say bahr nkla awr awnt ky nak ky lgam pkr kr asay ghtnay tyk dya، phr apny tlwar nkal kr as shkhs kay sr pr mara۔ phr myn as awnt kw laya js ky zyn awr hthyar thay، phr jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm awr lwg mjh say mlay tw aap nay pwchha kh as shkhs kw ks nay mara hay؟ an kay yh jwab dynay pr kh yh alaqw ka byta hay، aap nay frmaya: as ka sara mal ghnymt hay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3963","abw sayd alkhdry nay kha: jb b qryzh nay hthyar dal dyay awr as bat pr razy hw gyay kh an ky qsmt ka fyslh sad bn kryga۔ maaz kw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay blwaya awr wh gdhay pr swar hwyay۔ jb wh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay qryb phnchay tw frmaya: apnay srdar kay lyay athw۔ phr jb wh aa kr byth gya tw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”yh lwg hthyar dal kr as bat pr mtfq hw gyay hyn kh tm an ky qsmt ka fyslh krw“، tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”myn fyslh krta hwn kh lrnay walay maray jayyn awr awlad kw qyd kr lya jayay۔ phr as nay aalan kya kh tm nay an kay baray myn badshah ka fyslh dya hay۔ ayk wrzhn hay، \khda ka fyslh۔\"" (bkhary w mslm)"""""
"3964","abwhryrh rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay njd ky trf kchh swar bhyjay awr wh bny hnyfh kay ayk aadmy kw layay js ka nam smamh bn tha۔ awthl jw ahl ymamh ka srdar tha awr asay msjd kay stwnwn myn say ayk say bandh dya۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm bahr tshryf layay awr frmaya: tm kya amyd kr rhay hw smamh؟ as nay jwab dya، \mhmd، myn khyr ky amyd rkhta hwn، agr tm mjhay qtl krw gay tw as kw qtl krw gay js kay khwn ka bdlh lya jayay ga، agr tm ahsan krw gay tw shkr gzar kw dkhao gay، awr agr tm mal chahw gay awr mangw gay tw tmhyn as myn say jtna chahw dya jayay ga۔\"" rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay asay aglay dn tk chhwr dya، awr as say pwchha، \""tm kya amyd kr rhay hw، smamh؟\"" as nay jwab dya kh myn as bat ka antzar kr rha hwn jw myn nay tm say kha tha، agr tm ahsan krw gay tw shkr gzar kw dkhao gay، agr tm mjhay qtl krw gay tw as kw qtl krw gay js kay khwn ka bdlh lya jayay ga، awr agr tm jayydad chahw gay awr mangw gay tw as myn say jtna chahw gay tmhyn dya jayay ga۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay asay aglay dn tk chhwr dya، awr as say pwchha، \""tm kya amyd kr rhay hw، smamh؟\"" as nay jwab dya kh myn as bat ka antzar kr rha hwn jw myn nay tm say kha tha، agr tm ahsan krw gay tw shkr gzar kw dkhao gay، agr tm mjhay qtl krw gay tw as kw qtl krw gay js kay khwn ka bdlh lya jayay ga، awr agr tm jayydad chahw gay awr mangw gay tw as myn say jtna chahw gay tmhyn dya jayay ga۔ phr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”smamh kw aazad kr dw۔ wh msjd kay pas kchh khjwr kay drkhtwn kay pas gya awr ghsl kr kay msjd myn dakhl hwa awr kha kh myn gwahy dyta hwn kh allh kay swa kwyy mabwd nhyn awr myn gwahy dyta hwn kh mhmd sly allh alyh wslm as kay bnday awr rswl hyn، myn allh ky qsm kha kr khta hwn kh rwyay zmyn pr myray lyay aap say zyadh nfrt angyz kwyy chhrh nhyn tha، lykn aap ka chhrh sb say zyadh pyara hw gya hay، mjhay aap kay dyn say zyadh pyara kwyy nhyn tha۔ lykn aap ka dyn mjhay sb say zyadh pyara hw gya hay kh aap say zyadh nfrt krnay waly kwyy bsty nhyn thy، lykn aap kay ghr swarwn nay mjhay as wqt pkr lya jb myn amrh kay lyay ja rha tha، tw aap kay khyal myn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay aap kw mbarkbad dy awr kha kh aap sly allh alyh wslm nay ksy say mlaqat ky؟ as nay jwab dya kh nhyn، myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay sath aslam qbwl kya hay۔ myn khda ky qsm kha kr khta hwn kh ymamh say tmharay pas gyhwn ka ayk danh bhy nhyn aayay ga jb tk kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm as ky ajazt nh dyn۔ *sbaot۔ fal sba ka ayk many hmaqt ky trf pltna hay۔ yh tjwyz kya gya hay kh yhan yh fal sba kay many myn astamal hwa hay js ka mtlb hay ksy ka mzhb bdlna۔ htmy hmzh fal aksr hmzh kw gra dytay hyn، lykn jb wh aysa krtay hyn tw wh aam twr pr htmy waw kay bjayay htmy ya fal kay nmwnay ky pyrwy krtay hyn۔ mslm nay asay nql kya hay awr bkhary nay asay zyadh akhtsar kay sath byan kya hay۔"""""
"3965","jbyr by۔ mtam nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say bdr myn lyay gyay qydywn kay baray myn byan kya kh agr mtam bn ady zndh hwtay awr mjh say an ghlyzwn kay baray myn bat krtay tw myn anhyn an kay lyay chhwr dyta۔ * wh by nwfl kay srbrah thay۔ as nay tayf say wapsy kay bad mhmd kw thfz dynay pr rzamndy zahr ky jhan wh abw talb ky mwt kay bad gyay thay۔ ghzwh bdr say phlay almtam ka antqal hwgya۔ wh mslman nhyn hwa۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"3966","hzrt ans rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh asy mkh kay lwg tnym kay phar say rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay khlaf mslh hw kr atray awr aap sly allh alyh wslm awr aap kay sathywn kw bay khbry myn lay jana chahtay thay، lykn aap sly allh alyh wslm nay bghyr lray an kw qyd kr lya awr chhwr dya۔ ayk nskhh khta hay kh as nay an kw aazad kr dya awr allh taalyٰ nay nazl frmaya، ’’why hay js nay mkh ky wady myn an kay hath tm say awr tmharay hath an say hta dyay‘‘ (alqraan؛ 48:24)۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"3967","qtadh nay byan kya kh ans bn. malk nay abw tlhh ky rwayt say an say zkr kya kh jng bdr myn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay qrysh kay chwbys mzbwt aadmywn kw bdr kay knwyn myn say ayk knwyn myn dalnay ka hkm dya jw pthrwn say jra hwa tha jw kh khrab awr khrab tha۔ jb wh ksy dshmn pr ghalb aaya tw mydan jng myn tyn ratyn thhray۔ awr jb bdr ka tysra dn aaya tw as nay apnay swar kw zyn myn dalnay ka hkm dya۔ as kay bad wh apnay sathywn kay pychhay chl pra yhan tk kh wh knwyn kay mnh pr phnchay، jb aap nay anhyn an kay namwn awr an kay bapwn kay namwn say pkarna shrwa kya awr kha: flan flan flan flan ka byta، flan flan ka byta، kya tmhyn yh psnd hay kh tm nay allh awr as kay rswl ky ataat ky، hm nay hmaray rb ka hm say jw wadh kya tha asay scha paya، kya tm nay tmharay rb ka wadh scha paya؟ amr rzy allh anh nay kha: aay allh kay rswl aap js kw mkhatb kr rhay hyn wh srf jsm hyn jn myn rwh nhyn hay۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: as zat ky qsm js kay hath myn mhmd ky jan hay، tm an say bhtr nhyn sn sktay jw myn khta hwn۔ ayk wrzhn hay، \aap an say bhtr nhyn sn sktay، lykn wh jwab nhyn day sktay۔\"" (bkhary w mslm۔) bkhary nay mzyd kha kh qtadh nay kha kh khda nay anhyn zndh kya awr an kw dant dpt، zlt، antqam awr ghm awr twbh kay zryah snaya۔"""""
"3968","mrwan awr almswar b۔ mkhrmh nay byan kya kh jb hwayn ka wfd aslam qbwl krnay kay lyay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas aaya awr aap sly allh alyh wslm say an kay mal awr asyr kw waps krnay ka kha tw aap sly allh alyh wslm khray hwyay awr frmaya: an dwnwn myn say ksy ayk kw chn lw، ya tw qydy hw ya mal۔ jb anhwn nay jwab dya kh anhwn nay apnay asyrwn ka antkhab kya hay tw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm khray hw gyay awr allh ky tsbyh krnay kay bad mnasb andaz myn frmaya: aagay brhw: tmharay bhayy twbh kr kay aayay hyn awr myn nay swcha hay kh myn an kay asyrwn kw waps kr dwn، as lyay tm myn say jw qydywn ky rhayy kay khwahshmnd hyn wh as kay mtabq aml kryn، lykn jw chahtay hyn kh allh taalyٰ nay jw kchh dya hay، wh phlay hm kw day dyn gay۔ lwgwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw btaya kh wh qydywn kw rha krnay pr aamadh hyn، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”myn tm myn say an lwgwn myn frq nhyn kr skta jnhwn nay yh dya hay awr jnhwn nay nhyn dya، as lyay waps aao takh tmharay srdar mjhay tmharay baray myn btayyn۔ anhwn nay aysa hy kya awr an kay srdarwn nay an say bat krnay kay bad waps rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas aakr btaya kh wh razy hyn awr anhwn nay ajazt day dy hay۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"3969","'amran by۔ hsyn nay kha: sqyf bn aqyl kay hlyf thay، chnanchh jb sqyf nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay dw sathywn kw qyd kr lya tw as kay sathywn nay by aqyl kay ayk aadmy kw qyd kr lya، asay bandh kr lawa kay mydan myn phynk dya۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm as kay pas say gzray awr aap sly allh alyh wslm nay asay pkara، \mhmd، mhmd، mjhay ks lyay lya gya hay؟\"" as nay jwab dya، ''tmharay hlyf sqyf kay jrm kay lyay''۔ phr wh asay chhwr kr chla gya، lykn jb as nay \""mhmd، mhmd\"" pkara tw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw as pr trs aaya awr waps aa kr as say apnay baray myn pwchha۔ jb as nay asay btaya kh wh mslman hay tw as nay kha: \""agr tm nay yh kha hwta jb tm apnay aaqa thay tw tm pwry trh kamyab hw jatay۔ *as ka mtlb yh hay kh wh nh srf aglay jnm myn jnt myn jayay ga blkh as kay asyr hwnay kay tjrbay say bhy bch jayay ga۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"""""
"3970","aayshh rzy allh anha nay byan kya kh jb mkh walwn nay apnay qydywn kw fdyh dynay kay lyay bhyja tw zynb nay abwalaas kw fdyh dynay kay lyay kchh mal bhyja awr as kay drmyan apna ayk har bhyja jw khdyjh kay pas tha awr jb as nay abwalaas say shady kay wqt apnay sath bhyja tha۔ jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay yh dykha tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”agr tm smjhtay hw kh tm as kay qydy kw as kay lyay aazad kr dw awr jw kchh as ka hay asay waps kr dw tw achha hw ga۔ as pr wh razy hw gyay۔ nby sly allh alyh wslm nay an say maahdh kya tha kh wh zynb kw apnay pas aanay dyn، chnanchh aap sly allh alyh wslm nay zyd kw bhyja۔ harsh awr mddgarwn myn say ayk shkhs nay an say kha kh yajj 2 ky wady myn antzar kryn yhan tk kh zynb aayyn awr asay apnay sath waps lay aayyn۔ 1. jng bdr kay bad۔ 2. tnaym kay qryb۔ asay ahmd awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"3971","anhwn nay btaya kh jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay bdr myn lwgwn kw qyd kya tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay aqbh rzy allh anh kw qtl kr dya۔ aba mayt awr alndr by۔ alhars، lykn abw azaa aljmay pr ahsan kya۔ yh shrh alsn myn mntql hwty hay۔"
"3972","abn msawd rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay aqbh kw qtl krnay ka aradh kya۔ abw mayt say pwchha kh bchwn ky dykh bhal kwn kray ga tw as nay jwab dya kh jhnm hw gy۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"3973","aly rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya kh jbrayyl alyh alslam an kay pas aayay awr aap say frmaya: ”an (yany apnay sathywn) kw bdr kay qydywn kay baray myn an ka akhtyar dw kh an kw qtl kya jayay ya fdyh dya jayay، as shrt pr kh aglay sal an myn say atny hy tadad kw qtl kya jayay۔ anhwn nay jwab dya kh hm fdyh qbwl kryn gay awr hm myn say baz kw qtl kr dya jayay ga۔ trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay awr kha hay kh yh ghryb rwayt hay۔"
"3974","atyh qrzy nay kha: myn qryzh kay an qydywn myn say tha jnhyn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay samnay laya gya tha۔ shabh nay hmara maaynh kya tw jn kay bal agnay lgay thay wh maray gyay lykn jn kay bal nhyn brhay thay anhyn qtl nhyn kya gya۔ anhwn nay myry shrmgah kw khwla awr jb dykha kh bal nhyn brhay tw anhwn nay mjhay qydywn myn dal dya۔ abwdaod، abn majh awr darmy nay asay rwayt kya hay۔"
"3975","aly rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh slh say qbl hdybyh kay dn kchh ghlam rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas aayay awr an kay aaqaon nay aap kw kht lkha kh hm khda ky qsm mhmd ky qsm khatay hyn kh wh aap kay pas aap kay dyn ky khwahsh say nhyn nklay hyn blkh anhwn nay srf ghlamy say bhagnay kay lyay aysa kya hay۔ kchh lwgwn nay asay yqyn dlaya kh anhwn nay sch kha hay awr asay an kay pas waps bhyjnay ka mshwrh dya، lykn rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay ghsay myn aakr frmaya: myn nhyn smjhta kh tm qrysh kay lwg as wqt tk baz nh aao gay jb tk kh khda tmharay pas kwyy nh bhyjay jw as kay lyay tmharay sr kat day۔ as nay anhyn waps bhyjnay say ankar kr dya، yh bchatay hwyay kh wh khda kay aazad krdh thay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"3976","abn amr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay khald rzy allh anh kw bhyja۔ alwlyd nay by hdymh kw blaya awr anhyn aslam qbwl krnay kay lyay blaya۔ jb anhwn nay apnay qbwl aslam ka shyh twr pr azhar nh kya blkh khnay lgay kh ’’hm nay apna mzhb bdl lya hay، hm nay apna mzhb bdl lya hay‘‘ tw khaldؓ nay anhyn qtl krna awr qydy bnana shrwa kr dya awr hm myn say hr ayk kw qydy swnp dya۔ lykn jb ayk dn aysa aaya kh khald nay hm myn say hr ayk kw apnay qydy kw qtl krnay ka hkm dya tw myn nay kha kh khda ky qsm myn apnay qydy kw qtl nhyn krwn ga awr myray sathywn myn say kwyy bhy apnay qydy kw as wqt tk qtl nhyn kray ga jb tk kh hm nby sly allh alyh wslm kay pas nh aayyn۔ jb hm nay as say as maamlay ka zkr kya tw as nay apnay hath athayay awr dw bar kha، \aay khda، myn khald nay jw kchh kya hay as say tyry nzr myn apnay aap kw bay gnah qrar dyta hwn۔\"" *yhan fal sba astamal hwa hay۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"""""
"3977","abw talb ky byty am hany rzy allh anha nay kha: myn fth kay sal rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas gyy tw aap kw ghsl krtay hwyay dykha kh aap ky byty fatmh rzy allh anha aap kw kpray say prdh kr rhy thyn۔ myn nay slam kya awr as nay pwchha kh whan kwn hay، phr jb myn nay asay btaya kh myn abw talb ky byty am hany hwn tw as nay kha: khwsh aamdyd am hany۔ ghsl say fargh hwnay kay bad aap athay awr kpray myn lpyt kr aath rkat nmaz prhy، awr jb aap sly allh alyh wslm fargh hwyay tw myn nay arz kya: aay khda kay rswl، myry man kay bytay aly nay kha hay kh wh ayk aysay shkhs kw qtl krnay wala hay jsay myn nay pnah dy hay، flan hbyrh kay bytay kw۔ as nay jwab dya kh hm nay an kw aman dy hay jn kw tm nay ata kya hay am hany۔ as nay kha kh yh dwphr myn tha۔ (bkhary w mslm) trmzy kay ayk nskhay myn anhwn nay kha kh myn nay apnay shwhr kay dw mrd rshth darwn kw thfz dya hay awr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay jwab dya kh hm nay an kw aman dy hay jn kw aap nay dy hay۔"
"3978","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”awrt lwgwn kay lyay kam krty hay، yany mslmanwn ky trf say hfazt krty hay۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"3979","amrw by۔ alhmq nay byan kya kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh frmatay hwyay sna kh js nay ksy aadmy kw aman dy awr phr asay qtl kr dya qyamt kay dn as pr khyant ka jhnda lgaya jayay ga۔ yh shrh alsn myn mntql hwty hay۔"
"3980","slym by۔ amyr nay kha: maawyh awr bazntynywn kay drmyan ayk ahd tha awr wh an kay mlk ky trf jarha tha۔ phr jb ahd khtm hwa tw as nay an pr hmlh kya۔ ayk aadmy ghwray ya ghwray pr swar hw kr aaya awr khnay lga: allh sb say bra hay، allh sb say bra hay، wfadary hw awr khyant nh hw۔ 'abash۔ maawyh nay an say as baray myn swal kya tw as nay jwab dya kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh frmatay hwyay sna hay kh jb ksy ka lwgwn say ahd hw tw asay as wqt tk as myn nrmy ya mzbwty nh kray jb tk kh as ky mdt nh aajayay ya wh an kay sath maahdh kr kay asay khtm kr day۔ as nay kha kh maawyh phr lwgwn kw waps lay gya۔ mrqat، 4، 255 khta hay kh amrw bn ''abash nay mhsws kya kh apnay mlk myn rhtay hwyay maahdh krna awr phr dshmn kay mlk say as wqt rjwa krna jb maahdh ky mdt khtm hwnay kay qryb thy، takh fwry hmlh krnay kay qabl hw skay۔ asay trmzy awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"3981","abw rafa rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh mjhay qrysh nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas bhyja awr jb myn nay aap sly allh alyh wslm kw dykha tw myray dl myn aslam atr gya، tw myn nay kha: allh kay rswl! as nay jwab dya kh myn ahd shkny nhyn krta awr nh hy qasd kw qyd krta hwn blkh waps aao awr agr tmhyn wysa hy lgta hay jysa kh abhy kr rhay hw tw waps aajao۔ chnanchh myn chla gya awr phr rswl allhﷺ kay pas aaya awr aslam qbwl kya۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"3982","naym b۔ msawd rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay msylmh say aanay walay dw aadmywn say frmaya: ”myn khda ky qsm kha kr khta hwn kh agr rswl qtl nh hwtay tw myn tmharay sr kat dyta۔ asay ahmd awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"3983","amrw by۔ shayb nay apnay wald kay hwalay say btaya kh an kay dada nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw apnay khtbh kay dwran byan krtay hwyay frmaya tha kh \qbl jahlyt myn qaym hwnay walay athad kw pwry trh say yad rkhyn، kywnkh as say yany aslam hy asay mzbwt kray ga، lykn aslam myn kwyy nya athad nh kryn۔\"" zryah nhyn dya gya hay۔ dykhyay trmzy، syar، 30"""""
"3984","abn msawd rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh jb msylmh kay qasd abn nwhh awr abn asal nby sly allh alyh wslm kay pas aayay tw aap nay an say pwchha kh kya anhwn nay gwahy dy hay kh aap allh kay rswl hyn؟ an kay as jwab pr kh \hm gwahy dytay hyn kh msylmh allh kay rswl hyn،\"" anhwn nay kha، \""myn khda awr as kay rswl pr ayman rkhta hwn، agr ksy rswl kw qtl krna myra mamwl hwta tw myn tmhyn qtl kr dyta۔\"" abdallh (yany abn msawd rzy allh anh) nay kha kh rswl kw qtl nh krnay ky snt as wqt nafz hw gyy۔ ahmd nay asay mntql kya۔"""""
"3985","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”hm say phlay ksy kay lyay ghnymt hlal nhyn thy، as lyay kh allh taalyٰ nay hmary kmzwry awr aajzy kw dykha awr asay hmaray lyay hlal kr dya۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3986","abw qtadh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh hm hnyn kay sal rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay sath nklay، jb lshkr aaps myn mlay tw mslmanwn kw alta nqsan hwa۔ myn nay dykha kh mshrkwn myn say ayk mslmanwn myn say ayk say bhtr hwta hay tw myn nay apny tlwar as kay kndhay pr pychhay say mary awr as ka zrh kat dya۔ wh myray pas aaya awr myray sath bnd kr dya، takh myn nay mhsws kya kh mwt qryb hay، lykn mwt nay asay pkr lya awr mjhay janay dya. phr myn nay amr bn khtab kw pkr lya۔ alkhtab nay as say pwchha kh lwgwn ka kya maamlh hay tw as nay jwab dya kh allh taalyٰ nay yhy hkm dya hay ؎ phr wh waps aayay awr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm byth gyay awr frmaya kh agr kwyy ksy aadmy kw qtl kray awr sabt kr skay tw as ka mal ghnymt mlay ga۔ myn nay kha، myray lyay kwn gwahy day ga؟ awr phr byth gya. nby sly allh alyh wslm nay phr why kha awr myn nay kha: \kwn myry gwahy day ga؟\"" 2 awr phr byth gya۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay phr why frmaya awr myn khra hw gya، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay pwchha: qtadh aap kw kya hwa؟ awr jb myn nay asay khbr dy tw ayk aadmy nay kha kh as nay sch kha hay، myray pas as ka mal ghnymt hay، lhza asay as kay bdlay myn kchh lynay pr razy krw۔ abwbkr rzy allh anh nay kha kh as swrt myn myn khda ky qsm kha kr khta hwn kh as nay aysa nhyn kya۔ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya kh myn nay sch kha hay awr as aadmy say kha kh asay myray hwalay kr dw۔ as nay aysa hy kya awr myn nay by slymh kay drmyan ayk bagh khryd lya۔ yh phly jayydad thy jw myn nay aslamy dwr myn hasl ky thy۔ 1. as nay tajb kya kh mslman dshmnwn say kywn bhagay، awr amr nay jwab dya kh yh why hay jw khda nay hkm dya tha۔ 2. as myn shk hay kh abw qtadh nay phly dw mrtbh blnd aawaz say kha ya batn myn۔ trjmh myn myn nay arby kay alfaz ka skhty say khyal rkha hay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"""""
"3987","abn amr rzy allh anhma khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay ayk aadmy awr as kay ghwray kay lyay tyn hsay rkhay، ayk as kay lyay awr dw as kay ghwray kay lyay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3988","yzyd by۔ hrmz nay byan kya kh njdh alhrwry nay abn abas rzy allh anh kw kht lkha kh kya ghlam awr awrt mal ghnymt ky tqsym kay wqt mwjwd hwn tw an kw hsh dya jayay awr as nay yzyd say kha kh wh lkh kr yh btayay kh wh as hsay kay hqdar nhyn hyn، albth thwry sy rqm dy jayay۔ ayk rwayt myn hay kh abn abas rzy allh anh nay anhyn lkha kh aap nay mjh say pwchha kh kya rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm awrtwn kw fwjy mhmat pr lay jatay thay awr kya aap sly allh alyh wslm nay anhyn kwyy hsh dya tha، aap sly allh alyh wslm anhyn fwjy mhmat pr bymarwn ky dykh bhal kay lyay lay jatay thay، awr anhyn thwra sa mal ghnymt dya jata tha، lykn jhan tk ayk hsh ka talq hay، anhwn nay an kw yh tqsym nhyn kya۔"
"3989","slamh by۔ akw nay kha: rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay apnay swarwn kw apnay khadm rbah kay sath bhyja awr myn bhy as kay sath gya۔ sbh kay wqt abdalrhmn alfzary nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay swarwn pr chhaph mara tw myn ayk tylay pr chrh gya awr tyn bar mdynh ky trf mnh krkay aawaz dy: sbh ka hmlh! phr myn an lwgwn kay pychhay chla gya jw an pr tyr chla rhay thay awr rjz mytr myn yh alfaz lkhtay thay kh \myn alaqw ka byta hwn، aaj zlyl lwgwn ka dn hay\""* myn an pr gwlyan chlata rha awr an kay drndwn kw marta rha kh anhyn pydl hy jana pra yhan tk kh kwyy swary wala janwr nh tha js kay sr pr khda kay rswl nay pyda nh kya hw۔ phr myn an pr gwly chlatay hwyay an kay pychhay gya yhan tk kh anhwn nay apnay aap kw hlka krnay kay lyay tys say zyadh chadryn awr tys nyzay phynk dyay awr anhwn nay myray awpr pthr dalay bghyr kwyy chyz nhyn phynky takh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm awr aap kay sathy an pr nshan lgayyn۔ yh slslh chlta rha yhan tk kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay swarwn kw dykha۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay ghr swar aba qtadh nay abdalrhmn kw pkr kr qtl kr dya awr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”aaj hmara bhtryn ghr swar abw qtadh awr bhtryn pyadh slamh hay۔ phr as nay mjhay dw hsay dyyay ayk ghwr swar ka awr ayk pyadh ka awr yh dwnwn mjhay dynay kay bad mdynh wapsy pr mjhay apnay pychhay aladbh pr lay gyay۔ *layn، jw wazh twr pr rjz mytr kay qtr ky ayk msal hay، shrwa myn kchh ghayb hay۔ yh jata hay: ana abn alakwa walywm alrza rjz ky mkml shkl myn paon mstfzylwn chh mrtbh hay۔ qtr myn yh char gna hay۔ awpr ky str myn shrwa myn dw azafy hrfwn ky zrwrt hay۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"""""
"3990","abn amr rzy allh anhma nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm apnay lyay mal ghnymt bhyjnay walay dstwn myn say kchh kw dytay thay، khas twr pr tmam lshkr kw tqsym krnay kay alawh۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"3991","as nay kha: rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay hmyn hmaray panchwyn hsay kay alawh ghnymt dya awr mjhay ayk shrf mla jw bht prana awnt hay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4428","abn abas rzy allh anhma khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay mrdwn myn say mkhns awr mrdwn ky mshabht krnay waly awrtwn pr lant frmayy awr frmaya kh anhyn apnay ghrwn say nkal dw۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"4429","anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt ky hay kh aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”allh taalyٰ nay an mrdwn pr lant ky hay jw awrtwn ky mshabht akhtyar krtay hyn awr an awrtwn pr jw mrdwn ky mshabht krtay hyn۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"4430","abn amr rzy allh anhma say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jhwtay bal jwrnay waly awrt pr awr mangnay waly pr، gwdnay waly awrt pr awr mangnay waly awrt pr allh ky lant hay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4431","arfan s930 abdallh by۔ msawd nay kha: khda nay gwdnay waly awrtwn pr awr khwd gwdnay waly awrtwn pr lant ky hay، apnay chhrwn say bal akharnay waly awr khwbswrty kay lyay dantwn kay drmyan jgh bnanay waly، khda ky tkhlyq kw bdlnay waly۔ jb ayk awrt nay aakr asay btaya kh as nay sna hay kh as nay flan flan kw lant bhyjy hay tw as nay pwchha kh kywn nh an pr lant bhyjwn jn pr khda kay rswl nay lant ky hay awr jn ka zkr khda ky ktab myn hay۔ as nay asay btaya kh as nay asay ayk say awpr tk prha hay awr as myn wh kchh nhyn mla jw wh khh rha tha، js pr as nay jwab dya kh agr as nay asay prha hwta tw asay ml jata، awr as say pwchha kh kya as nay nhyn prha، \rswl tmhyn kya laya hay qbwl krw، awr js say mna kya hay as say baz rhw۔\"" (qraan، 59، 7) as kay jwab myn kh as nay kya tha، as nay kha kh as nay mna kya tha js kay baray myn wh bat kr rhay thay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"""""
"4432","abwhryrh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”nzr bd ka asr shyh hay“ awr gwdnay say mna frmaya۔ (as rwayt say malwm hwta hay kh gwdnay kw nzr bd say bchanay kay lyay astamal kya jata tha۔) bkhary nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4433","abn amr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw phtay hwyay balwn kay sath dykha hay۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"4434","ans rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay mrdwn kw zafran astamal krnay say mna frmaya۔ (mrqat، iv، 461، khta hay kh yh an kay lbas awr an kay jsmwn pr lagw hwta hay، kywnkh yh awrtwn ka rwaj hay lykn as kay mamwly astamal say mna nhyn krta hay۔) (bkhary w mslm)"
"4435","aayshh rzy allh anha khty hyn kh wh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw sb say zyadh mythy khwshbw lgaty thyn، yhan tk kh aap sly allh alyh wslm kay sr awr darhy pr atr chmkta hwa nzr aata tha۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4436","nafa khtay hyn kh jb abn amr rzy allh anh nay khwshbw lgayy tw wh atr ky lkry astamal krtay thay js myn kwyy awr khwshbw nhyn mlty thy، awr kafwr bhy astamal krtay thay jsay wh aylws ky lkry kay sath mlatay thay۔ phr as nay kha kh khda kay rswl nay as trh khwshbw lgayy hay۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"4437","abn abas rzy allh anhma khtay hyn kh nby krym sly allh alyh wslm apny mwnchhwn kw trashtay ya atartay thay، awr rhmn kay dwst abrahym alyh alslam krtay thay۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"4438","zyd by۔ arqm nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ka arshad nql kya hay kh \jw apny mwnchhyn nhyn atarta wh hm myn say nhyn hay۔\"" asay ahmd، trmzy awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"4439","amrw by۔ shayb؛ apnay wald kay akhtyar myn، an kay dada nay byan kya kh nby sly allh alyh wslm apny darhy kay phlw awr nychay say kchh atartay thay۔ trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay awr kha hay kh yh ghryb rwayt hay۔"
"4440","yala b۔ mrh nay byan kya kh jb nby sly allh alyh wslm nay apnay awpr kchh khlq (ayk maya، zrd atr jw zyadh tr zafran pr mshtml hwta hay) dykha tw aap nay pwchha kh kya aap ky kwyy bywy hay، jb aap nay jwab dya kh myn nay nhyn hay tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: asay dhw، phr dhw، phr dhw، awr dwbarh astamal nh krw۔ asay trmzy awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4441","abw mwsyٰ rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”allh taalyٰ as aadmy ky daa qbwl nhyn krta js kay bdn pr khlws hw۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4442","amar by۔ yasr nay kha: myn sfr kay bad apnay ghr walwn kay pas hath bandh kr aaya awr anhwn nay mjhay zafran say khwshbw lga dy۔ sbh hwyy tw myn nby krym sly allh alyh wslm kay pas gya awr aap kw slam kya، lykn aap sly allh alyh wslm nay jwab dynay kay bjayay frmaya kh jao awr asay dhw dalw۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4443","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”mrdwn kay lyay atr wh hay js ky khwshbw zahr hw lykn rng chhpa hw، awr awrtwn kay lyay wh atr hay js ka rng zahr hw lykn js ky bw chhpy hw، asay trmzy awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4444","ans nay kha kh khda kay rswl kay pas skh tha (rmk say bna hwa ayk atr، ayk syah madh jw mshk myn mlaya jata tha، asay thwnsnay awr nm krnay kay ayk wsya aml kay bad astamal krnay say phlay ayk sal kay lyay chhwr dya jata tha۔ kha jata hay kh as kay atr myn amr brhnay kay sath sath bhtry aayy hay۔ Cf. mrqat، iv، 463 f. abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4445","anhwn nay kha kh khda kay rswl aksr apnay sr pr chknayy krtay awr darhy myn knghy krtay thay awr wh aksr sr pr dwpth phntay thay gwya as ka lbas (js ky wzaht trjyhy malwm hwty hay wh yh hay kh yhan lfz \lbas\"" say mrad wh chadr hay jw pgry kw chknayy say bchanay kay lyay astamal kya jata hay۔"""""
"4446","am hany rzy allh anha khty hyn: hmaray pas rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ayk bar mkh myn tshryf layay awr aap kay balwn kay char plray thay۔ asay ahmd، abwdaod، trmzy awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4447","aayshh rzy allh anha nay byan kya kh jb anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay balwn kw alg kya tw aap sly allh alyh wslm kay sr ka taj alg kr dya awr aap ky pyshany ka bal apny aankhwn kay drmyan ltka dya۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4448","abdallh by۔ mghfl nay kha kh allh kay rswl nay hr dwsray dn kay alawh balwn myn knghy krnay say mna frmaya hay۔ asay trmzy، abwdaod awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4449","abdallh by۔ brydh nay btaya kh ayk aadmy nay fdala say pwchha۔ abyd nay asay kywn mntshr dykha awr jwab dya kh khda kay rswl nay anhyn bht zyadh aysh w ashrt say mna kya hay۔ as nay pwchha kh as nay asay bay lbas kywn dykha tw as nay jwab dya kh khda ka rswl anhyn baz awqat nngay paon janay ka hkm dya krta tha۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4450","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”js kay bal hwn wh as ky tazym kray۔ abwdaod nay asay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4451","abwzr rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”sb say bhtryn chyzyn jn say sfyd bal bdltay hyn wh hyn mhndy awr ktm (slam kay drkht kay ptay) balwn myn mhndy lganay say as ka asl rng mhfwz rhta hay، ktm kw balwn ka rng hlka krnay kay lyay bhy kha jata hay) trmzy awr abwdaod nay asay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4452","abn abas rzy allh anhma say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”aakhry zmanay myn kchh lwg aysay hwn gay jw as syah khzab kw kbwtr ky khyty ky trh astamal kryn gay jnhyn jnt ky khwshbw nhyn mlay gy۔ asay abwdaod awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4453","abn amr rzy allh anhma khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm chmray kay jwtay phntay thay awr apny darhy kw jngwn (ymn myn pylay rng ka ayk pwda، tl ky trh) awr zafran say rngtay thay۔ awr abn amr rzy allh anh aysa krtay thay۔ nsayy nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4454","abn abas rzy allh anhma byan krtay hyn kh jb ayk shkhs nay apnay aap kw mhndy say rnga hwa tha tw aap sly allh alyh wslm kay pas say gzra، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”yh ktna achha hay!“ jb ayk awr shkhs js nay apnay aap kw mhndy say rnga hwa tha، whan say gzra tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”yh as say bhtr hay۔ phr jb ayk awr shkhs js nay khwd kw zrd rng say rnga hwa tha gzra tw as nay kha kh yh an sb say bhtr hay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4455","hzrt abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya kh sfyd bal bdlw awr yhwdywn ky nql nh krw۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"4456","nsayy nay asay abn amr awr zbyr say rwayt kya hay۔"
"4457","awr amam nsayy nay asay abn amr awr abn zbyr ؓ say rwayt kya hay ۔ shyh ، rwah alnsayy ۔ asnadh hsn ، rwah alnsayy ۔"
"4458","amrw by۔ shayb nay apnay wald ky trf say btaya kh an kay dada nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh bat btayy۔ ’’sfyd balwn kw nh akharw، kywnkh yh mslman ka nwr hyn، jw shkhs aslam myn ayk bal bhy agata hay، allh taalyٰ as kay lyay as kay lyay ayk nyky lkhta hay، as kay lyay ayk gnah mtata hay awr as kay lyay as ka ayk drjh blnd krta hay۔‘‘ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4459","kab b۔ mrh nay khda kay rswl kw yh khtay hwyay rpwrt kya kh \agr kwyy aslam myn ayk bal bhy sfyd kray ga tw yh qyamt kay dn as kay lyay nwr hwga۔\"" asay trmzy awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"4460","aayshh rzy allh anha nay kha: myn awr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ayk brtn say ghsl krtay thay۔ awr as kay bal thay jw kndhay tk nhyn phnchtay thay blkh kan say nychay aatay thay۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"4461","abn hnzlyh jw kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay ashab myn say ayk hyn، nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt ky hay kh aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”khrym alasdy ayk achha aadmy hwta agr as kay bal kndhwn tk nh phnchtay awr js trh wh apnay kpray kw nychay ltkanay dyta۔ jb khrym nay sna kh as nay chaqw lay kr apnay balwn kw apnay kanwn kay brabr kat dya awr apna nchla lbas apny tangwn kw aadha awpr kr lya۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4462","ans nay kha kh as kay pas balwn ka ayk ltka hwa tala tha awr as ky waldh nay an say kha kh asay nh katw، kywnkh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm asay khynch kr pkr lytay thay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4463","abdallh by۔ jafr rzy allh anh khtay hyn: rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay jafr kay khandan say mlnay say phlay tyn dn antzar kya (jafr bn abw talb kw snh 7 hjry myn mwta myn qtl kya gya tha)۔ as nay kha aaj kay bad myray bhayy kay lyay nh rwna awr phr kha kh myray bhayy kay bchwn kw myray pas blao۔ jb hmyn kyy mrghywn ky trh laya gya tw as nay kha، ’’mjhay hjam blao‘‘ awr phr asay hkm dya kh hmaray sr mndwadyn۔ asay abwdaod awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4464","am atyh ansaryh rzy allh anha khty hyn kh nby sly allh alyh wslm nay ayk awrt say jw mdynh myn lrkywn ka khtnh kya krty thy، frmaya: ”qta nh krw، kywnkh yh awrt kay lyay bhtr hay awr shwhr kay lyay zyadh psnd hay۔ abwdaod nay asay rwayt kya hay awr kha hay kh yh zayf rwayt hay js ka nql krnay wala ayk namalwm aadmy hay۔"
"4465","krymh bnt hmam nay byan kya kh ayk awrt nay aayshh rzy allh anha say mhndy rngnay kay baray myn pwchha tw anhwn nay jwab dya kh kwyy hrj nhyn lykn mjhay yh psnd nhyn hay، myray mhbwb kw as ky khwshbw napsnd thy۔ asay abwdaod awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4466","aayshh rzy allh anha nay byan kya kh jb atbh ky byty hnd nay kha، \khda kay rswl، myry byat kw qbwl kryn،\"" aap nay jwab dya، \""jb tk aap apnay hathwn ky hthylywn myn frq nh kryn، kywnkh wh shkary janwr kay pnjwn ky trh dkhayy dytay hyn۔\"" (yh khnay ka ayk mzbwt tryqh kh js awrt kay hath pr mhndy nh lgay wh bdswrt hyn) abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"""""
"4467","as nay btaya kh ayk awrt nay prday kay pychhay say yh asharh kya kh as kay pas khda kay rswl kay lyay ayk kht hay۔ nby sly allh alyh wslm nay yh khh kr apna hath bnd kr lya kh \myn nhyn janta kh yh mrd ka hath hay ya awrt ka\"" awr jb as nay aalan kya kh yh awrt ka hay tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya، \""agr tm awrt hwty tw apnay nakhnwn myn frq krty\"" yany mhndy kay sath۔ asay abwdaod awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"4468","abn abas rzy allh anhma nay kha kh jhwtay bal bnanay waly awrt awr mangnay waly، dwsray lwgwn kay lyay bal nkalnay waly awrt awr apnay aap kw saf krnay waly awrt، gwdnay waly awrt awr js nay aysa krwaya jb as kay jwaz ky kwyy bymary nh thy۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4469","abwhryrh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay as mrd pr lant frmayy js nay awrt jysa lbas phna awr as awrt pr jw mrd jysa lbas phnay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4470","abn abw mlykh khtay hyn kh jb ksy nay aayshh rzy allh anha say kha kh ayk awrt syndl phnty hay (mrdwn kay jwtay kay hwalay say) tw anhwn nay jwab dya kh allh kay rswl nay mrdanh awrtwn pr lant frmayy hay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4471","swban nay byan kya kh jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm sfr pr gyay tw an kay khandan kay aakhry frd kw fatmh nay dykha awr wapsy pr sb say phlay fatmh say mlaqat ky۔ ayk mrtbh jb wh ayk mhm say waps aayay tw as nay apnay drwazay pr balwn ka kpra ya prdh ltka dya tha awr hsn w hsyn kw chandy kay kngnwn say aarasth kya tha، as lyay jb wh phnchay tw andr nh gyay۔ yh swch kr kh asay andr janay say rwk dya gya tha jw as nay dykha tha as nay prdh phar dya، lrkwn kay kngn ataray awr anhyn kat dya۔ wh rwtay hwyay khda kay rswl kay pas gyay awr jb aap nay anhyn an say lay lya tw aap nay frmaya: \as kw flan khandan kay pas lay jao، swban، yh myray ghr walay hyn awr mjhay yh psnd nhyn kh wh mwjwdh zndgy myn an ky achhy chyzwn say ltf andwz hwn، fatmh kw asb ka har khrydyn (many wazh nhyn hay، tjwyz kya jata hay kh as ka mtlb hay kh as say mrad janwr kay kndwn ya jwrwn kay jwrwn kay kndwn myn kata jana) hay۔ hpwpwtyms)، thwban، awr dw hathy dant (ya، 'kchhway kay khwl' ('aj) kay kngn۔\"" ahmd awr abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"""""
"4472","abn abas rzy allh anhma say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”srmh lgayyn kywnkh yh bynayy kw saf krta hay awr balwn kw agata hay۔ awr as nay zwr day kr kha kh nby sly allh alyh wslm kay pas kalyrym ka ayk kys tha js say aap nay hr rat hr aankh myn tyn bar kalyrym lgaya tha۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"4473","anhwn nay kha kh nby krym sly allh alyh wslm swnay say phlay hr aankh myn tyn bar antymwny lgatay thay، awr aap nay frmaya: \tm jw sb say achhy dwayyn lgatay hw wh mnh kay kwnay myn ghwnt bhrtay hyn، jw nak kw msh krtay hyn، syngy، rfa hajt krtay hyn، sb say achhy chyz jw aankhwn pr lgayyn wh ayntymwny hay، kywnkh yh bynayy kw saf krta hay awr balwn kw agata hay، awr satwyn dn kay lyay bhtryn pyalh hay۔ akyswyn.\"" jb khda kay rswl kw aasman ky syr kay lyay lay jaya gya tw frshtwn ky hr jmaat kay pas say gzrtay hwyay kha، \""sngy lganay ka aml jary rkhw۔\"" trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay awr kha hay kh yh hsn ghryb rwayt hay۔"""""
"4474","aayshh rzy allh anha khty hyn kh nby sly allh alyh wslm nay mrdwn awr awrtwn kw hmam myn janay say mna frmaya، lykn bad myn mrdwn kw ajazt dy kh wh nchlay kpray phn kr dakhl hwn۔ asay trmzy awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4475","abwalmlyh nay byan kya kh hms ky kchh awrtyn aayshh kay pas aayyn awr anhwn nay pwchha kh wh khan say hyn؟ an kay jwab pr kh wh sham say aayay hyn، as nay kha kh shayd tm as alaqay say aayay hw jhan ky awrtyn hmam myn jaty hyn۔ anhwn nay jwab dya kh aysa hy hay، awr phr as nay anhyn btaya kh as nay khda kay rswl kw yh khtay sna hay kh awrt apnay awr apnay rb kay drmyan prday kw htayay bghyr apnay shwhr kay ghr kay alawh apnay kpray nhyn atarty۔ ayk wrzhn hay، \as kay ghr kay alawh as kay awr khda kay drmyan jw azym awr shan wala hay as kay prday kw pharay bghyr۔\"" asay trmzy awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"4476","abdallh by۔ amrw nay khda kay rswl kw bchatay hwyay kha: \ghyrwn ky srzmyn tmharay lyay fth hw jayay gy، awr tm as myn hmam kay ghr pao gay، mrdwn kw an myn bghyr kprwn kay dakhl nhyn hwna chahyay، awrtwn kw an say dwr rkhyn، swayay an kay jw bymar hwn ya bchpn myn hwn۔\"" abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"""""
"4477","jabr rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw shkhs allh awr ywm aakhrt pr ayman rkhta hw wh bghyr kpray kay ghsl myn nh jayay، jw shkhs allh awr ywm aakhrt pr ayman rkhta hw wh apny bywy kw ghsl myn nh layay، awr jw shkhs allh awr ywm aakhrt pr ayman rkhta hw wh aysay kpray pr nh bythay js myn shrab chlayy ja rhy hw۔ asay trmzy awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4478","sabt nay byan kya kh jb ans say pwchha gya kh kya nby sly allh alyh wslm nay apnay balwn kw rnga hay tw anhwn nay jwab dya، \agr myn an kay sr kay balwn kw gnna chahta tw myn aysa kr skta tha،\"" anhwn nay mzyd kha kh anhwn nay apnay balwn kw rng nhyn kya۔ ayk rwayt myn anhwn nay mzyd kha kh abwbkr nay apnay balwn kw mhndy awr ktm say rnga awr amr nay akylay hy mhndy say rnga۔ (bkhary w mslm)"""""
"4479","abn amr rzy allh anh apny darhy kw pylay rng say pyla krtay thay takh an kay kpray as say bhr jayyn۔ as say pwchha gya kh as nay pyla khzab kywn astamal kya tw jwab dya kh myn nay khda kay rswl kw asay btwr khzab astamal krtay hwyay dykha hay awr as say bhtr kwyy chyz asay psnd nhyn thy، wh apnay tmam kpray yhan tk kh apny pgry kw bhy as say rngtay thay۔ asay abwdaod awr nsayy nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4480","asman by abdallh by۔ mhb nay kha: myn am slmh rzy allh anha say mlnay gya tw anhwn nay hmaray lyay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay kchh bal nkalay jw rngay hwyay thay۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"4481","abwhryrh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh ayk mkhnth js nay apnay hath paon mhndy say rngay hwyay thay، rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay pas laya gya، aap sly allh alyh wslm nay pwchha: ”as aadmy ka kya hal hay؟ yh btanay pr kh as nay khwatyn kay athnay bythnay kw mtasr kya hay، as nay asay nqy myn jlawtn krnay ka hkm dya۔ lwgwn nay mshwrh dya kh wh asay qtl kr dyn، lykn as nay kha kh mjhay nmazywn kay qtl say mna kya gya hay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4482","alwlyd b۔ aqbh nay kha: jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay mkh fth kya tw ahl mkh apnay lrkwn kw lay kr aanay lgay awr aap sly allh alyh wslm an pr drwd bhyjtay awr an kay srwn pr hath phyrtay۔ mjhay laya gya lykn chwnkh myn zafran ky aamyzsh say khwshbw lga chka tha as nay atr ky wjh say mjhay hath nhyn lgaya۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4483","abw qtadh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say kha: myray kndhwn pr talay lgay hwyay hyn، tw kya myn knghy krwn؟ as nay jwab dya: han، awr as ky tazym krw۔ abw qtadh aksr asay dn myn dw bar chknayy dytay thay kywnkh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: han، awr as ky tazym krw۔ mlk nay asay mntql kya۔"
"4484","alhjaj by۔ hsn nay kha: hm ans rzy allh anh ky ayadt kay lyay gyay۔ malk، awr myry bhn almghyrh nay mjhay btaya kh as wqt myn balwn kay dw tkhtwn wala nwjwan tha (mtn myn qrn ya qstan ka zkr hay۔ phlay ka mtlb pyshany pr dw trfh awr bad walay dw tkhtay hwn gay۔ as ka mtbadl wazh twr pr dya gya hay kywnkh transmytr kw yqyn nhyn hay kh kwn sa lfz shyh hay) awr as nay myray sr ka msh kya، awr an dwnwn klpwn pr daa ky، awr an dwnwn klpwn pr daa ky۔ yh yhwdywn ka andaz hay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4485","aly nay kha kh khda kay rswl nay mna kya hay kh awrt apna sr mndwayay۔ nsayy nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4486","'ata' b۔ ysar nay byan kya kh jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm msjd myn thay tw ayk aadmy js ka sr awr darhy bkhry hwyy thy dakhl hwa، rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay as ky trf as trh asharh kya jysay aap sly allh alyh wslm asay hkm day rhay hwn kh apnay bal awr darhy kw trtyb dyn۔ jb wh aysa krchka awr waps aaya tw khda kay rswl nay frmaya: kya yh as say bhtr nhyn kh tm myn say kwyy apnay sr kw pragndh krkay aayay، gwya wh shytan hay۔ mlk nay asay mntql kya۔"
"4487","abn almsyb kw yh khtay hwyay sna gya: \khda achha hay awr khwshbwdar chyzwn kw psnd krta hay (tyb 'achha' hay awr tb' 'atr' ya 'khwshbw' hay؛ saf awr sfayy psnd hay؛ skhy awr skhawt psnd hay؛ mhrban awr ahsan psnd hay؛ lhza pakyzgy (myray khyal myn) ، anhwn nay kha kh aap ky adalt nhyn hay ، awr as nay kha۔ myn nay as ka zkr mhajr say kya۔ msmar awr as nay kha kh asay aamr bn nay btaya tha۔ sad، apnay wald ky trf say، kh nby sly allh alyh wslm nay kchh aysa hy kha tha، lykn aap nay frmaya: \""apnay aangnwn kw saf krw۔\"" asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"""""
"4488","yhyyٰ by۔ sayd nay byan kya kh anhwn nay sayd bn kw sna۔ almsayb khtay hyn: rhmn ka dwst abrahym wh phla aadmy tha js nay mhman ky mhman nwazy ky، phla khtnh krwaya، phla aadmy js nay apny mwnchhyn trashyn، awr wh phla aadmy js nay sfyd bal dykhay، tw as nay kha: aay myray rb yh kya hay؟ rb jw babrkt awr blnd hay as nay jwab dya، \azt، abrahym۔\"" as nay kha aay myray rb mjhay mzyd azt ata frma۔ mlk nay asay mntql kya۔"""""
"4489","abw tlhh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”frshtay as ghr myn dakhl nhyn hwtay js myn kta ya tswyr hw۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4490","abn abas rzy allh anhma nay mymwnh rzy allh anh ky rwayt say byan kya kh ayk sbh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ghm kay maray khamwsh hw gyay awr frmaya: jbrayyl alyh alslam nay kl rat mjh say mlaqat ka wadh kya tha lykn anhwn nay aysa nhyn kya، myn khda ky qsm kha kr khta hwn kh as say phlay kbhy wadh khlafy nhyn ky۔ as kay bad as nay ayk ktay kay bchay kay baray myn swcha jsay as nay apnay khymay kay nychay dykha tha (fstat mrqat، iv، 484 smjhta hay kh yhan as say mrad swfh hay) awr jb as nay hkm dya awr asay bahr rkha tw as nay apnay hath myn thwra sa pany lay kr as jgh chhrk dya jhan wh tha۔ sham kw jbrayyl alyh alslam an say mlay tw anhwn nay kha kh tm nay kl mjh say mlnay ka wadh kya tha، js pr anhwn nay jwab dya kh han lykn hm as ghr myn dakhl nhyn hwtay js myn kta ya tswyr hw۔ chnanchh agly sbh khda kay rswl nay hkm dya kh ktwn kw mar dya jayay، htyٰ kh hkm dya kh chhwtay baghwn ky hfazt krnay walay ktwn kw mar dala jayay، lykn bray baghwn ky hfazt krnay walwn kw chhwr dya jayay۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"4491","aayshh rzy allh anha nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay apnay ghr myn slyb ky shkl waly kwyy chyz nhyn chhwry awr asay tlf nhyn kya۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"4492","as nay btaya kh as nay ayk tkyh khryda js pr tswyryn thyn awr jb khda kay rswl nay asay dykha tw drwazay pr rk gyay awr andr nhyn gyay۔ as kay chhray pr napsndydgy kay aasar dykh kr as nay kha، \khda kay rswl، myn khda awr as kay rswl ky trf twbh krty hwn، myn nay kya ghlt kya hay؟\"" as nay pwchha as tkyay ka kya mtlb hay؟ awr jb as nay jwab dya kh as nay asay as kay bythnay awr tyk lganay kay lyay khryda tha tw aapﷺ nay frmaya: ''yh tswyryn bnanay walwn kw qyamt kay dn azab dya jayay ga awr an say kha jayay ga kh jw kchh anhwn nay bnaya hay asay zndh krw''۔ (bkhary w mslm)"""""
"4493","as nay btaya kh as nay apnay ayk stwr rwm kw ayk prday kay sath askryn kya tha js pr aadad w shmar thay awr nby sly allh alyh wslm nay asay phar dya۔ as lyay as nay as myn say dw tkyay bnayay awr anhyn ghr myn bythnay kay lyay rkh dya۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4494","wh khty hyn: nby sly allh alyh wslm ayk mhm pr nklay awr mjhay ayk qalyn mla jsay myn nay drwazay pr prday kay twr pr ltkaya tha، lykn jb aap sly allh alyh wslm nay aakr qalyn kw dykha tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay asay khynch kr phar dya awr frmaya kh allh taalyٰ nay hmyn pthr awr mty phnnay ka hkm nhyn dya۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4495","anhwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt ky kh aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”qyamt kay dn sb say skht azab wh lwg hwn gay jw allh ky bnayy hwyy chyzwn ky nql krtay hyn۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4496","abwhryrh rzy allh anh nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm ka yh byan sn kr byan kya kh allh taalyٰ frmata hay: ”as say brh kr zalm kwn hay jw as chyz kw pyda kray jysay myn nay pyda kya hay، aysay lwgwn kw ayk aytm bnanay dyn، ayk danh ya jw ka ayk danh bnayyn“۔ (bkhary w mslm)۔"
"4497","Abdullah bin Mas'ood (Radi Allahu Anhu) ne bayan kiya ke maine Allah kay Rasool (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko yeh farmate suna: \Allah ke nazdeek sab se sakht azaab un logon ko hoga jo tasveerien banate hain.\"" (Yaani woh log jo tasveerien is liye banate hain ke unki parastish ki jaye"","" ya jo janwaro ki tasveerien banate hain). (Bukhari aur Muslim)."""""
"4498","abn abas rzy allh anhma say mrwy hay kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmatay hwyay sna: ”jw kwyy chyz kw byan kray ga wh jhnm myn jayay ga، awr as nay jw bhy byan kya hay as kay bdlay myn ayk rwh pyda ky jayay gy jw asay jhnm myn azab day gy۔ abn abas rzy allh anh nay kha: agr tmhyn yh krna hy hay tw drkhtwn awr an chyzwn ky tswyryn bna lw jn myn rwh nhyn hay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4499","as nay btaya kh as nay khda kay rswl kw yh khtay hwyay sna kh agr kwyy khwab dykhay jw as nay nh dykha hw tw asay dw jw kay danay mlanay ka kam dya jayay ga lykn wh aysa krnay say qasr rhay ga، agr kwyy dwsray lwgwn ky batyn snta hay jb wh asay snna nhyn chahta ya as say bchnay ky kwshsh krta hay tw as kay kanwn myn sysh dala jayay ga awr wh qyamt kay dn ksy chyz ky nmayndgy kray ga۔ sza dy awr as myn sans lynay ka kam dya، lykn aysa krnay say qasr hwn gay۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"4500","brydh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw bykgymn khylta hay gwya as nay apna hath swr kay gwsht awr khwn myn dbwya hay۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"4501","abwhryrh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay byan kya kh jbrayyl alyh alslam an kay pas aayay awr kha kh myn kl rat aap kay pas aaya tha awr srf as wjh say dakhl hwnay say rwka gya tha kh drwazay pr tswyryn thyn، kywnkh as pr tswyryn lgy hwyy thyn awr ghr myn ayk kta tha، as lyay hkm dw kh ghr kay drwazay pr jw tswyr hay as kay sr kw kat dya jayay takh prday ky shkl myn dw drkht bn jayyn۔ phylao js pr lwg chlyn awr hkm dyn kh ktay kw bahr nkal dya jayay۔ khda kay rswl nay phr aysa hy kya۔ asay trmzy awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4502","as nay khda kay rswl ka byan krtay hwyay kha: \qyamt kay dn jhnm say ayk hsh nklay ga js ky dw aankhyn hwn gy، dw kan hwn gay jw sntay hwn gay awr ayk zban hw gy jw bwlty hw gy، awr wh khay ga kh asay tyn tbqwn pr mamwr kya gya hay: hr wh jw mtkbr awr ht dhrmy krnay wala hay، hr wh shkhs jw khda kay sath dwsray mabwd kw pkarta hay، awr wh lwg jw khda kay sath dwsray mabwd kw pkartay hyn۔\"" asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"""""
"4503","abn abas rzy allh anhma say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”allh taalyٰ nay shrab، msyr awr kwbh kw hram qrar dya hay awr frmaya: hr nshh aawr chyz hram hay۔ kwba kw dhwl kha jata hay۔ byhqy nay asay shab alayman myn nql kya hay۔"
"4504","abn amr rzy allh anhma khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay shrab، msyr، kba awr ghbyrh say mna frmaya jw hbshywn ka jwar say tyar krdh nshh aawr mshrwb hay۔ asay skrwka khtay hyn۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4505","abw mwsyٰ ashary rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”js nay bykgymn khyla as nay allh awr as kay rswl ky nafrmany ky۔ asay ahmd awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4506","abwhryrh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay ayk aadmy kw kbwtr kay pychhay pychhay dykha tw frmaya: ”shytan shytan kay pychhay lga hwa hay۔ asay ahmd، abwdaod، abn majh awr byhqy nay shab alayman myn rwayt kya hay۔"
"4507","sayd by۔ abwalhsn khtay hyn kh jb abn abas rzy allh anh kay pas thay tw ayk shkhs an kay pas aaya awr khnay lga: abn abas myn wh aadmy hwn js ky rwzy myray hath kay kam say hwty hay awr myn an chyzwn kw byan krta hwn۔ abn abas nay jwab dya kh myn asay srf why btaon ga jw as nay khda kay rswl say sna hay۔ as nay asay yh khtay sna tha، ''agr kwyy ksy chyz ky nmayndgy krta hay tw khda asay as wqt tk sza day ga jb tk kh wh as myn rwh nh phwnk day، awr wh aysa kbhy nhyn kr skay ga۔'' phr jb wh shkhs hanpta hwa pyla hw gya tw as nay as say kha، ''tm pr! agr aap kw aysa krna hy hay tw an drkhtwn awr ksy aysy chyz ky nmayndgy kryn js myn rwh nh hw۔\ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"""""
"4508","aayshh rzy allh anha nay byan kya kh jb nby sly allh alyh wslm bymar thay tw aap ky baz azwaj nay maryh namy klysa ka zkr kya۔ am slmh awr am hbybh jw hbshh gyy thyn، nay as ky khwbswrty awr as myn mwjwd mjsmwn ka tzkrh kya tw aap nay apna sr athaya awr frmaya kh jb an lwgwn myn say kwyy nyk aadmy mr jayay tw wh as ky qbr pr abadt gah bnatay hyn، phr as myn mjsmay bna lytay hyn، yh khda ky bdtryn mkhlwq hyn۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4509","abn abas rzy allh anhma say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”qyamt kay dn sb say skht azab wh hw ga js nay ksy nby kw qtl kya، ya ksy nby kw qtl kya، ya as kay waldyn myn say ksy kw qtl krnay wala، batwn kw byan krnay wala، awr wh aalm jw as kay alm say kwyy faydh nh athayay“۔"
"4510","aly khtay thay shtrnj ghyrwn ky msyr hay۔"
"4511","abn shhab nay byan kya kh abw mwsyٰ ashary khtay thay kh shtrnj srf gnhgar hy khylta hay۔"
"4512","anhwn nay btaya kh jb an say shtrnj khylnay kay baray myn pwchha gya tw as nay jwab dya kh as ka talq fzwl chyz say hay awr allh taalyٰ kw bykar chyz psnd nhyn hay۔ byhqy nay shab alayman myn char rwayat nql ky hyn۔"
"4513","abwhryrh rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm baz ansar kay ghr tshryf latay thay lykn as kay qryb ayk ghr tha js myn aap kbhy nhyn gyay۔ as say lwgwn kw pryshany hwyy، tw anhwn nay kha، \khda kay rswl، aap flan kay ghr tshryf latay hyn، lykn hmaray ghr kbhy nhyn jatay۔\"" aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”yh as lyay hay kh tmharay ghr myn kta hay،“ anhwn nay kha، ”an kay ghr myn ayk bly hay،“ aap sly allh alyh wslm nay jwab dya، ”bly shkary janwr hay۔ (jw wzaht dy gyy hay wh yh hay kh bly apnay shkar kw marnay kay lyay apnay dantwn ka astamal krty hay awr wh napak nhyn hay jbkh kta gndgy khata hay awr asay napak smjha jata hay۔) darqtny nay asay mntql kya۔"""""
"4514","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”allh taalyٰ nay kwyy aysy bymary nhyn atary jb tk as ka alaj nh kya hw۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"4515","jabr rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”hr bymary ky dwa hay، awr jb bymary pr dwa lgayy jaty hay tw allh kay hkm say shfaa hwty hay۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"4516","abn abas rzy allh anhma say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”tyn chyzwn myn alaj hay: shyshh ka chyra، shhd ka pyna، ya aag say daghna، lykn myn apny amt kw daghnay say mna krta hwn۔ bkhary nay nql kya hay۔"
"4517","jabr rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh athad ky lrayy myn aby kay bazw ky drmyany rg myn ayk tyr lga awr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay asay dagh dya۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔ * yany khndq ky jng، 5 hjry۔"
"4518","anhwn nay btaya kh jb sayd bn maaz kw an kay bazw ky drmyany rg myn gwly lgy thy، rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay apnay hath say asay chwray tyr walay sr say dagh dya۔ as kay bad wh phwl gya awr as nay dwsry bar asay dagh dya۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"4519","as nay btaya kh aby bn kay pas khda ka rswl bhyja hay۔ kab ayk tbyb js nay as ky ayk rg kat kr asay dagh dya۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"4520","Abu Huraira (Radi Allahu Anhu) ne riwayat kiya ke maine Allah kay Rasool (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ko yeh farmate suna: \Kalonji (Shuneez) har bimaari ki dawa hai magar 'Saam' (maut) ke alawah.\"" Ibn Shihab ne kaha: 'Saam' ka matlab maut hai"","" aur kalonji ko 'Shuneez' kehte hain. (Bukhari aur Muslim)."""""
"4521","abw sayd khdry rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh ayk aadmy nby akrm sly allh alyh wslm kay pas aaya awr btaya kh aap kay bhayy ky aantyn khly hwyy hyn، tw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya kh asay shhd plao۔ as nay aysa hy kya awr phr aa kr kha kh myn nay asay pynay kay lyay dya tha lykn as say as ky aantyn mzyd dhyly hw gyy hyn۔ as nay tyn bar yh kha awr jb wh chwthy bar aaya awr kha gya kh asay shhd plao tw as nay kha kh myn nay aysa kya hay lykn as say dhyla pn brh gya hay۔ khda kay rswl nay jwab dya kh khda nay sch kha awr tyray bhayy ky aantyn jhwt bwlyn۔ phr asay pynay kay lyay dya awr wh sht yab hw gya۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4522","ans nay khda kay rswl ka byan krtay hwyay kha، \aap jw bhtryn tby alaj krtay hyn wh sngy awr smndry lbas hyn۔\"" (bkhary w mslm)"""""
"4523","as nay khda kay rswl kw yh khtay hwyay rpwrt kya: \apnay bchwn kw byzh myn swjn ky wjh say nchwrnay say tklyf nh dw blkh kasts lgayyn۔\"" (bkhary wmslm)"""""
"4524","am qys rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”tm byzh kw as trh kywn dbatay hw، as hndwstany aylwys ky lkry ka astamal krw، kywnkh as myn sat qsm ky dwayyn hyn، an myn say pleurisy ka alaj hay، asay nak kay zryaay byzh ky swjn kay lyay lgaya jata hay awr pleurisy kay lyay mnh kay phlw myn dala jata hay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4525","aayshh awr rafa by۔ khdyjh rzy allh anha say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”bkhar jhnm ky grmy ky wjh say hay، lhza asay pany say thnda krw۔ (bkhary w mslm)۔"
"4526","ans nay kha kh khda kay rswl nay nzr bd، bchhw kay dnk awr chhwtay aablwn kay lyay daa ka astamal krnay ky ajazt dy۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"4527","aayshh rzy allh anha khty hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay hkm dya kh hm nzr bd kay khlaf daa kryn۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4528","am slmh rzy allh anha khty hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay an kay ghr myn ayk lrky kw dykha js kay chhray pr sfa yany zrdy thy awr frmaya: ”as kay lyay daa krw، kywnkh as pr nzr bd lg gyy hay۔ (bkhary w mslm۔) *sfa kw shytan ky trf say zrb، ya nzr bd kay asr say tabyr kya gya hay۔ asay sfa prha ja skta hay js ka mtlb hay kala pn، ya srkh rng kay sath syahy mayl hwna۔ sfra ka mtlb aam twr pr pyla pn hay، lykn as ka mtlb kala pn bhy hw skta hay، awr yhan as ky yhy tfsyr hwny chahyay، as swrt myn sfah prhna chahyay۔"
"4529","jabr rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay daa krnay say mna frmaya awr amrw bn aas rzy allh anh kay ghr walay bhy۔ hazm nay aakr kha: \khda kay rswl، hmaray pas ayk daa kargr sabt hwyy thy jsay hm nay bchhw kay katnay kay lyay lgaya tha، lykn aap nay daa say mna kya hay۔\"" anhwn nay asay pysh kya tw aap nay frmaya kh myn as myn kwyy hrj nhyn dykhta، agr tm myn say kwyy apnay bhayy kw faydh phnchanay ky asttaat rkhta hw tw wh aysa kray۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"""""
"4530","awf by۔ malk ashjay khtay hyn: zmanh jahlyt myn hm mntr kya krtay thay، awr hm nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say pwchha kh aap sly allh alyh wslm as kw kysay dykhtay hyn۔ aap nay frmaya: apny daayyn myray pas pysh krw، jb tk an myn shrk nh hw daa myn kwyy hrj nhyn۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"4531","abn abas rzy allh anhma say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”nzr bd asl hay agr hkm say phlay kwyy chyz hw jayay tw nzr bd kray gy، awr jb tm say ghsl krnay kw kha jayay tw aysa krw۔“* mslm nay rwayt ky hay۔ * yhan pr aml ky trf asharh as bab kay hsh dwm kay aakhr myn abw amamh ky rwayt say mlta hay۔"
"4532","asamh by sharq nay byan kya kh jb khda kay rswl say pwchha gya kh kya aap kw alaj ka astamal krna chahyay tw aap nay jwab dya: \han khda kay bndw، alaj say astfadh krw، kywnkh khda nay ayk bymary kw chhwr kr as ka alaj mqrr kyay bghyr nhyn bnaya، yany brhapa۔\"" asay ahmd، trmzy awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"4533","aqbh by۔ aamr nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt ky hay kh aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”apnay batl prstwn kw khanay pr mjbwr nh krw، kywnkh allh taalyٰ an kw khana pyna dyta hay۔ asay trmzy awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay، trmzy khtay hyn kh yh ghryb rwayt hay۔"
"4534","ans rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay asd rzy allh anh kw dagh dya۔ zrara ayk laly ky wjh say js say asay tklyf hwyy thy۔ trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay awr kha hay kh yh ghryb rwayt hay۔"
"4535","zyd by۔ arqm nay btaya kh khda kay rswl nay anhyn hkm dya kh wh smndry kasts awr zytwn kay tyl say blghm ka alaj kryn۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"4536","anhwn nay btaya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm zytwn ka tyl awr blghm kay lyay jngyn tjwyz krtay thay۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"4537","asmaa bnt amys rzy allh anha nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay an say pwchha kh wh kwn sa jlab astamal krty hay tw anhwn nay jwab dya kh as nay asprj astamal kya tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya kh yh bht grm hay۔ as kay bad as nay syna ka astamal ayk tafn kay twr pr kya، awr۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”agr ksy chyz myn mwt ka alaj hw tw wh synh hw gy۔ asay trmzy awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay، trmzy khtay hyn kh yh hsn ghryb rwayt hay۔"
"4538","hzrt abw drdaa rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”allh taalyٰ nay bymary awr shfa dwnwn nazl ky hyn awr as nay hr bymary kay lyay shfaa mqrr ky hay، lhza apna alaj krw، lykn kwyy hram chyz astamal nh krw۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4539","abwhryrh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay napak dwa say mna frmaya۔ asay ahmd، abwdaod، trmzy awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4540","nby krym sly allh alyh wslm ky khadmh slmyٰ nay byan kya kh ksy nay bhy rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say sr drd ky shkayt nhyn ky، jb aap sly allh alyh wslm nay aap kw synh lganay kay lyay kha، ya aap sly allh alyh wslm kay pyrwn myn drd ky shkayt nhyn ky، jb aap sly allh alyh wslm nay anhyn mhndy say rngnay kw nhyn kha۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4541","as nay kha kh khda kay rswl kay paon myn kbhy zkhm ya khwn nhyn aaya* bghyr asay mhndy lganay ka hkm dya tha۔ asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔ *nqbh astamal kya jata hay۔ as say mrad pthr ky wjh say paon myn chwt hay js say khwn nklta hay۔"
"4542","abw kbshh alanmary nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm apnay sr kay awpr awr kndhwn kay drmyan synh lgwaya krtay thay awr frmaya krtay thay: \agr kwyy as khwn myn say kchh bhayay ga tw asay tklyf nhyn hwgy agr as nay ksy chyz ka alaj nh kya hw۔\"" abwdaod awr abn majh nay asay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"4543","jabr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay ran kay awpr synh lgaya tha js say aap kw tklyf hwyy thy۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4544","abn msawd rzy allh anh khtay hyn: as rat kay baray myn byan krtay hwyay jb aap kw aasman pr lay jaya gya tw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya kh wh frshtwn ky ayk jmaat say nhyn gzray jb tk kh wh apny qwm kw syngy lganay ka hkm nh dyn۔ asay trmzy awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay، trmzy khtay hyn kh yh hsn ghryb rwayt hay۔"
"4545","abdalrhmn by۔ asman rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh jb ayk tbyb nay myndkwn kw dwayy myn dalnay kay baray myn nby sly allh alyh wslm say mshwrh kya tw aap nay anhyn marnay say mna frmaya۔ asay abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔ * myndkwn kay gwsht kw zytwn kay tyl myn mla kr sanp kay katnay kay lyay tryaq kay twr pr astamal kya jata tha awr chrby kw dant nkalnay myn mddgar smjha jata tha۔ myndkwn kw marnay ky mmanat ghalbaً srf dwaon kay mqasd kay lyay anhyn marnay pr lagw hwty hay۔"
"4546","ans rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm grdn kay atraf awr kndhay pr dw rgwn myn synh dala krtay thay۔ abwdaod nay asay rwayt kya hay، awr trmzy awr abn majh nay mzyd kha hay kh wh 17، 19 awr 21 tarykh kw synh lgaya krtay thay۔"
"4547","abn abas rzy allh anhma khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm 17، 19 awr 21 tarykh kw synh lgwana psnd krtay thay۔ bghwy nay asay shrh alsn myn mntql kya۔"
"4548","hzrt abwhryrh rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”js nay 17، 19 awr 21 tarykh kw pchhwara tw hr bymary ka alaj hay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4549","abw bkrh ky byty kbshh nay byan kya kh an kay wald apnay ghr walwn kw mngl kay dn synh lganay say mna krtay thay awr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay frman pr yh dawyٰ krtay thay kh mngl ka dn khwn ka dn hay js myn ayk ghry aysy hay kh wh nhyn rkta۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4550","zhry nay mrsl ky swrt myn byan kya hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”js nay bdh ya hfth kw synh lgaya hw awr asay kwrh ka mrz lahq hw tw asay chahyay kh wh apnay swa ksy pr alzam nh lgayay“۔ asay ahmd awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔ asay snd dy gyy hay lykn abwdaod nay kha kh yh shyh nhyn hay۔"
"4551","as nay mrsl ky shkl myn byan kya kh khda kay rswl nay kha: \agr ksy nay hfth ya bdh kay dn apnay aap kw syngy lgayy hay ya ksy chyz say dagh dya hay tw agr asay kwrh hw jayay tw asay apnay aap kay alawh ksy kw qswrwar nhyn thhrana chahyay۔\"" yh shrh alsn myn mntql hwty hay۔"""""
"4552","abdallh bn ky bywy zynb۔ msawd nay byan kya kh abdallh nay as ky grdn pr ayk dhaga dykha awr pwchha kh yh kya hay؟ jb as nay asay btaya kh yh ayk dhagh hay js pr as kay lyay mntr prha gya hay tw as nay asay lay lya، asay kat dya awr kha: ’’aap abdallh kay ghr walay shrk say bay nyaz hyn، myn nay rswl allh kw yh frmatay hwyay sna hay kh mntr، shr awr mhbt kay mntr shrk hyn۔ as nay jwab dya kh tm as trh kywn bwl rhay hwmyry aankh phwt rhy thy awr myn flan yhwdy kay pas jaty rhy awr jb as nay as pr jadw kya tw wh prskwn hwgya۔ abdallh nay kha، yh tw shytan ka kam tha jw asay apnay hath say chba rha tha، awr jb jadw kya gya tw wh baz aa gya، aap kw bs atna khna hay kh allh kay rswl nay kha، 'aay ansanwn kay rb، tklyf kw dwr kr، awr shfa day، tw hy shfa dynay wala hay، tyray pychhay bymary kay swa kwyy alaj nhyn hay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4553","jabr rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh jb nby sly allh alyh wslm say ayk shr kay baray myn pwchha gya tw aap nay frmaya: yh shytan kay kam say mtalq hay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔ *nshrh ayk jr say nklta hay js kay many mntshr hwtay hyn awr kha jata hay kh as ka astamal as kay lyay dlksh hay js kay pas hay kywnkh yh msybt kw mntshr krta hay۔"
"4554","abdallh by۔ amr rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh frmatay hwyay sna: \agr myn tryaq pyta hwn، ya tawyz bandhta hwn، ya shaary krta hwn، tw myn wh qsm hwn jsay as ky prwah nhyn hwty۔\""* abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔ *yany aysa kwyy kam krnay wala mrdwd krdar hay۔"""""
"4555","almghyrh b۔ shabh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: js nay apnay aap kw dagh dya ya jadw kya as nay apnay aap kw allh pr bhrwsh krnay say bry kr dya۔ asay ahmd، trmzy awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4556","' aysyٰ by۔ hmzh nay btaya kh wh abdallh bn msawd ky ayadt kay lyay gyay thay۔ aqym* jw erysipelas myn mbtla tha awr pwchha kh as nay tawyz kywn nhyn lgaya؟ as nay jwab dya: \hm as say khda ky pnah mangtay hyn، rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya kh agr kwyy ksy chyz kw apnay awpr ltkayay ga tw asay chhwr dya jayay ga۔\""  abwdaod nay rwayt ky hay۔ mrqat، iv، 510 ghlt tryqay say hkm dyta hay۔ sy ayf thzyb، v، 323 f۔  agr kwyy khda say mdd tlb krnay kay bjayay apnay shr pr bhrwsh kray tw as ky mdd as say rwk dy jayay gy۔"""""
"4557","'amran by۔ hsyn nay khda kay rswl kw yh khtay hwyay byan kya: \bry aankh ya bchhw kay dnk kay alawh kwyy daa nhyn ky jayay gy۔\"" asay ahmd، trmzy awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
"4558","asay abn majh nay brydh say rwayt kya hay۔"
"4559","ans rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”kwyy daa nhyn mangy jayay gy swayay nzr bd kay، ya bchhw kay dnk kay، ya khwn bhnay kay۔“* abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔ * abart myn bnd (khwn) hay، lykn kha jata hay kh khas twr pr nak say khwn aana yhan mrad hay۔ sy ayf myrqat، iv، 5U۔"
"4560","asmaa bnt amys nay kha: ya rswl allh، jafr kay bchay bry nzr kay asr myn aasany say mtasr hwtay hyn، tw kya myn an kay lyay daa mangwn؟ as nay jwab dya: han، kywnkh agr hkm say aagay kchh hw skta hay tw nzr bd hw skty hay۔ asay ahmd، trmzy awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4561","abdallh ky byty alshfaa rzy allh anha nay byan kya kh jb wh hfsh kay sath thyn tw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm tshryf layay awr frmaya: tm as kw jld kay phtnay ky daa kywn nhyn skhatay jysa kh tm nay asay lkhna skhaya tha؟ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4562","abw amamh by۔ shl by۔ hnyf nay btaya kh aamr bn rbyah nay shl kw dykha۔ hnyf nay ghsl kya awr kha kh khda ky qsm myn nay aaj jw kchh dykha hay as kay mqablay myn kwyy chmra nhyn dykha htyٰ kh ksy wyran lrky ky bhy nhyn۔ shl zmyn pr gr gya awr lwg khda kay rswl kay pas gyay awr an say kha: \khda kay rswl، kya aap shl bn hnyf kay lyay kchh kr sktay hyn؟ hm khda ky qsm kha kr khtay hyn kh wh apna sr nhyn atha skta\"" as nay pwchha kh kya anhyn ksy pr shbh hay، jb anhwn nay jwab dya kh anhyn amyr bn hnyf pr shbh hay۔ rblh allh kay rswl nay amyr kw blwaya awr as say skht bat krtay hwyay kha kh tm myn say kwyy apnay bhayy kw kywn marta hay، tm nay as ky trf say daa kywn nhyn mangy، as ky trf say ghsl kya، phr amyr nay apny trf say apna chhrh، hath، khnywn، ghtnwn awr anglywn kw dhwya، awr apny nchly chadr kay andr ja kr as kw nkala awr as kay awpr pany jma kya awr as kay awpr pany dal kr chla gya۔ lwg as say bdtr kwyy nhyn۔* yh shrh snt myn phylty hay۔ malk nay asay nql kya، awr as kay nskhay myn as nay kha: \""nzr bd asly hay، as kay lyay wzw krw۔\"" as lyay as nay aysa kya۔ * msybt an taryfy klmat ky wjh say thy jw khda ky mrzy kay ksy bhy hwalh say ahl nhyn thay، awr as kay mtabq nzr bd ky trf mnswb thay۔"""""
"4563","abwsayd khdry rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm jnat awr ansanwn ky nzr bd say allh ky pnah mangtay thay yhan tk kh mawztyn* nazl hw gyay، as kay bad aap sly allh alyh wslm nay an say astfadh kya awr baqy sb kchh trk kr dya۔ asay trmzy awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay، trmzy khtay hyn kh yh hsn ghryb rwayt hay۔ *qraan، 113 awr 114۔"
"4564","aayshh rzy allh anha nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay an say pwchha: kya aap kay drmyan mghyrh dykha gya hay؟ as nay pwchha kh as ka kya mtlb hay tw as nay jwab dya: yh wh lwg hyn jn myn jnat ky tngy hay۔ mrqat، iv، 514، khta hay kh aysa hwta hay agr kwyy mrd apny bywy say hmbstry krtay wqt khda ka zkr krnay say ghafl hw jayay۔"
"4565","Ibn Abbas (Radi Allahu Anhuma) se riwayat hai: \Sab se behtareen dawa jis se aap ilaaj karte hain...\"" yeh Bab-ut-Tarajjul mein aaya hai. (Yeh riwayat zaeef hai)."""""
"4566","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”madh jsm ka hwz hay awr rgyn as myn atr jaty hyn، jb madh sht mnd hwta hay tw rgyn sht mnd halt myn lwt aaty hyn awr jb khrab hwty hyn tw wh bymar hw kr waps aaty hyn۔"
"4567","aly rzy allh anh nay kha: ayk rat jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nmaz prh rhay thay tw aap nay apna hath zmyn pr rkha awr asay bchhw nay dsa، tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay asay apny jwty say mara awr asay mar dala۔ phr jb wh chla gya tw as nay kha: \khda bchhw pr lant kray، yh nmaz prhnay walay kw ya ksy awr kw، ya ksy nby kw ya ksy awr kw nhyn chhwrta۔\"" as kay bad as nay nmk awr pany mngwaya awr asay brtn myn dal kr apny angly pr dalna shrwa kya jhan as nay asay dnk mara tha awr asay pwnchh kr mawzatn prh kr khda ky pnah mangy۔ byhqy nay shab alayman myn dw rwaytyn nql ky hyn۔"""""
"4568","asman by abdallh by۔ mhb nay kha: myry qwm nay mjhay am slmh kay pas pany ka ayk pyalh day kr bhyja tha۔ jb bhy ksy pr nzr bd prty ya kwyy awr chyz as kay lyay ayk bysn bhyjty awr as nay rswl allh kay kchh bal nkalay jw as nay chandy ky ayk chhwty ghnty myn rkhay thay۔ myn nay chhwty ghnty myn dykha awr kchh srkh bal dykhay۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔ mrqat، iv، 515، khtay hyn kh agrchh as lfz ka mtlb ghnty hay، lykn yhan yh ghnty ky shkl myn ayk chhwta sa dbh astamal kya ja skta hay۔ yh as qsm ky ghnty hay jw df pr astamal hwty hay۔"
"4569","abwhryrh rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay baz shabh nay aap say kha kh trflz zmyn ka chychk hyn tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”mna ky ayk qsm hay awr an ka rs nzr bd ka alaj hay، ajwh ky khjwryn jnt say aaty hyn awr yh zhr ky dwa hyn۔ abwhryrh rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh anhwn nay tyn، panch ya sat trflz lyay، an kw dbaya، an ka rs ayk bwtl myn dala awr apny aankhwn waly lwndy kw aankh myn lwshn kay twr pr lgaya tw wh thyk hw gyy۔ trmzy nay asay rwayt kya hay awr kha hay kh yh hsn rwayt hay۔"
"4570","as nay khda kay rswl ka byan krtay hwyay kha: \agr kwyy hr mhynay myn tyn sbh shhd chatta hay، tw asay kwyy sngyn msybt nhyn phnchay gy.\"""""""
"4571","abdallh by msawd rzy allh anh nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh khtay hwyay rwayt kya hay: \dw alaj astamal krw: shhd awr qraan۔\"" abn majh awr byhqy nay shab alayman myn dw rwaytyn nql ky hyn، byhqy nay shyh kha hay kh dwsry rwayt abn msawd say zyadh pychhay nhyn jaty۔"""""
"4572","abw kbshh alanmary nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay zhr aalwd bkrywn ky wjh say khwd apnay sr kay awpr synh lgaya tha۔ mamr nay kha: myn nay zhr kay alawh ksy awr wjh say apnay sr kay bych myn as trh synh lgaya tha awr yaddasht myn kchh kmy waqa hwyy thy yhan tk kh mjhay nmaz myn fathh alktab astamal krnay ka mshwrh dya gya۔ razn nay asay mntql kya۔ 7 hjry myn fth khybr kay bad rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw zhr dynay ky kwshsh ky gyy، lykn jb aap nay zhr aalwd gwsht ka mnh bhr lya tw aap nay yh smjh kr thwk dya kh as myn zhr tha۔"
"4573","nafa khtay hyn kh abn amr rzy allh anhma nay an say kha kh wh bld pryshr myn mbtla hyn awr an say kha kh wh ayk kpr lay aayyn، awr an say kha kh ayk nwjwan kw zrwr lay aao awr dykhw kh wh bwrhay awr lrka nhyn layay۔ awr abn amr rzy allh anhma khtay hyn kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmatay sna hay: khanay say phlay synh lgana afzl hay، as say zhant brh jaty hay، yaddasht myn azafh hwta hay awr achhy yaddasht rkhnay walay ky yad myn azafh hwta hay، js nay khwd syngy lgayy hw asay chahyay kh wh jmarat ka antkhab kray، allh ka nam lay kr asay zyadh say zyadh kray، lykn jmah، hfth awr atwar kay dn sngy lganay say prhyz kryn، lykn pyr awr mngl kay dn synh lgwanay say prhyz kryn، lykn pyr awr mngl kay dn synh lgwayyn۔ tp dq awr jzam srf bdh ya mngl ky rat kw zahr hwta hay۔ asay abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4574","mql b۔ ysar nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh khtay hwyay rwayt kya: \mhynay ky 17 tarykh kw mngl kay dn synh lgana ayk sal ky bymary ka alaj hay۔\"" harb b. asmayl alkrmany، ahmd kay sathy، nay asay mntql kya، lykn as ky snd bay faydh hay۔ chnanchh almntqh myn byan hwa hay۔"""""
"4575","rzyn nay abwhryrh rzy allh anh kay akhtyar myn kchh asy asr kw mntql kya۔"
"4576","abwhryrh rzy allh anh nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw yh frmatay hwyay sna kh: ”shgwn nhyn lyna chahyay، lykn sb say achhy qsm nyk shgwn hay۔ as say pwchha gya kh nyk shgwn kya hay tw jwab dya kh achha klam jsay tm myn say kwyy sn lay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4577","as nay khda kay rswl kw yh khtay hwyay atlaa dy kh \kwyy anfykshn nhyn hay، kwyy bd shgwn nhyn، kwyy hma*، awr bhwkay pyt myn kwyy sanp nhyn*؛ lykn tp dq kay kwrh walay say aysay bhagw jysay shyr say۔\"" bkhary nay asay nql kya۔ * as lfz ka mtlb hay alw ya rat ka prndh jw ksrt say qbrwn myn aata hay۔ aslam say phlay kay arbwn ka aqydh tha kh jb maray janay walay ka antqam nh lya gya hw tw hama namy ayk prndh mrdh myn say nkl kr antqam ka mtalbh krnay lga۔  lfz sfr hay۔ qbl az aslam kay arbwn nay as lfz ka mtlb ayk sanp kay twr pr astamal kya tha jw ansan kw bhwk lgnay pr andr say kat lyta hay awr bhwk kay wqt ansan kw dnk marnay ka ahsas hwta hay۔ as myn pyt kay andr ayk sanp ka astamal bhy kya jata tha js kay baray myn khyal kya jata tha kh yh khjly ya khjly say zyadh mtady bymary ka sbb bnta hay۔"""""
"4578","as nay khda kay rswl kw yh khtay hwyay atlaa dy، \bhwkay pyt myn kwyy anfykshn، kwyy hma، awr kwyy sanp nhyn hay۔\"" ayk khanh bdwsh arb nay pwchha kh ya rswl allh، yh kysa hay kh jb awnt ryt myn as trh hwn jysay wh ghzal hwn* awr an kay drmyan ayk khjwr wala awnt aata hay tw wh anhyn khjwr dyta hay؟ khda kay rswl nay jwab dya، \""phlay kw ks nay mtasr kya؟\"" bkhary nay asay nql kya۔ * mwaznh an ky jld ky sfayy ky nshandhy krnay kay lyay astamal kya jata hay۔"""""
"4579","as nay khda kay rswl kw yh khtay hwyay rpwrt kya: \kwyy anfykshn nhyn hay، kwyy hma، kwyy starh barsh ka wadh nhyn krta، awr bhwkay pyt myn kwyy sanp nhyn hay۔\"" mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"""""
"4580","jabr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh myn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kw frmatay hwyay sna: \kwyy anfykshn nhyn hay، bhwkay pyt myn kwyy sanp nhyn hay awr nh hy kwyy bhwt hay۔\""* mslm nay asay mntql kya۔ * myn nay arby say makhwz angryzy lfz astamal kya hay۔ yh ayk aysy mkhlwq kay lyay astamal kya jata tha jw ayk qsm ka jny ya shytan tha js kay baray myn yh khyal kya jata tha kh wh mkhtlf shklwn myn lwgwn pr zahr hwta hay awr anhyn shra myn gmrah krta hay awr an ky tbahy ka sbb bnta hay۔"""""
"4581","amrw by۔ alshryd nay apnay wald ky snd say btaya kh sqyf kay wfd myn ayk shkhs tp dq kwrh ka mryz tha awr rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay asay pygham bhyja kh hm nay aap ky byat kr ly hay، aap ghr chlay jayyn۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"4582","abn abas rzy allh anhma nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay nyk shgwn lyay lykn brayy nhyn، awr yh kh aap kw ayk khwsh kn nam psnd tha۔ yh shrh alsn myn mntql hwty hay۔"
"4583","qtan b۔ qbysh nay apnay wald say rwayt ky hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: \prndwn kay arna، bdgmany،* awr bdshgwny lyna jhalt say mtalq hay۔\""  abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔ *tarq۔ yh qyas aarayy kay aml kay lyay astamal hwta hay js myn awrtyn pthr phynkty thyn۔ yh lkyryn khynch kr jywmnsy ka bhy astamal hwta hay۔  mn aljbt۔ jbt ka mtlb shytan hay awr jhalt bhy۔ ayk mtbadl trjmh yh hwga kh yh mshqyn shytan ky trf say aaty hyn۔"""""
"4584","abdallh by۔ msawd nay khda kay rswl ka byan krtay hwyay kha: \bdshgwny lyna shrk hay (asay tyn bar khna)۔ hm myn say kwyy bhy as say mtasr nhyn hwta hay، lykn khda apnay bhrwsay say as asr kw dwr krta hay۔\"" asay abwdaod awr trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔ trmzy nay byan kya kh anhwn nay mhmd sly allh alyh wslm kw sna hay۔ asmaayl* khtay hyn kh slyman bn hrb as rwayt kay baray myn kha krtay thay kh an ky rayay myn \""hm myn say kwyy bhy as say mtasr nhyn hwta، lykn khda apnay bhrwsay say as asr kw dwr krta hay\"" abn msawd kay alfaz hyn۔ *yany bkhary"""""
"4585","jabr rzy allh anh nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay ayk shkhs kw jw tp dq kay mrz myn mbtla tha hath say pkra awr asay apnay sath brtn myn rkh kr frmaya: allh pr bhrwsh rkhw awr as pr bhrwsh rkhw۔ asay abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4586","sad b۔ malk nay byan kya kh khda kay rswl nay frmaya: \kwyy hma nhyn hay، kwyy anfykshn nhyn hay awr kwyy bd shgwn nhyn hay، lykn agr kwyy chyz bd shgwn say mtasr hwty hay tw wh ghr، ghwra awr awrt hay۔\"" abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"""""
"4587","hzrt ans rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh jb nby sly allh alyh wslm ksy kam kay lyay bahr tshryf lay gyay tw aap kw yh sn kr khwshy hwyy kh ksy nay kha: aay rah rast pr aanay walay! asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔"
"4588","brydh nay byan kya kh nby sly allh alyh wslm nay ksy chyz say shgwn nhyn lya۔ lykn jb as nay ksy ayjnt kw bhyja tw as nay as ka nam pwchha awr agr yh asay psnd aaya tw as pr khwshy hwyy awr as ky khwshy as kay chhray pr nzr aarhy thy، lykn agr as nay apna nam napsnd kya tw as ky narazgy as kay chhray say ayan thy۔ jb wh ksy gaon myn dakhl hwa tw as nay as ka nam pwchha awr agr asay psnd aaya tw as pr khwshy hwyy awr as ky khwshy as kay chhray pr nzr aaty thy lykn agr asay as ka nam napsnd tha tw as ky narazgy as kay chhray say ayan thy۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4589","ans rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh ayk aadmy nay arz kya kh ya rswl allh hm ayk aysay thkanay myn thay js myn hmary tadad awr saman bht tha awr wh as thkanay myn bdl gya js myn hmary tadad awr saman km hw gya tha۔ as nay jwab dya kh asay chhwr dw kywnkh yh qabl mzmt hay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔"
"4590","yhyyٰ by۔ abdallh by۔ bhr nay kha kh asay ayk shkhs nay atlaa dy js nay frwa by kw sna tha۔ mwsyq btata hay kh as nay kha، \khda kay rswl، hmaray pas abyan* namy zmyn hay jw wh zmyn hay jhan hmaray khyt hyn awr apny fslyn agatay hyn، lykn yh bht ghyr sht bkhsh hay۔\"" as nay jwab dya kh chhwr dw kywnkh tbahy bymary kay qryb hwnay say hwty hay۔ abwdaod nay asay nql kya hay۔ * adn kay mshrq myn kchh abtdayy swarwn nay pkra hwa tha kh yh ya tw adyh ky chtanwn pr ayk jgh thy ya adn hy ka nam tha۔"""""
"4591","arwh by۔ amyr nay btaya kh jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay samnay shgwn lynay ka zkr hwa tw aap nay jwab dya kh sb say achhy qsm nyk shgwn hay، mzyd kha kh mslman ksy shgwn ky wjh say ksy chyz say pychhay nhyn htta۔ as nay an say kha kh jb an myn say kwyy kwyy aysy chyz dykhay jsay wh napsnd krta hay tw asay khna chahyay، \aay khda، tw akyla hy achhy chyzyn lata hay، tw hy brayywn kw rwkta hay، awr khda kay swa kwyy taqt awr taqt nhyn hay۔\"" abwdaod nay asay mrsl ky swrt myn nql kya hay۔"""""
"4592","maawyh b۔ alhkm nay byan kya kh anhwn nay kha: \khda kay rswl، hm zmanh jahlyt myn kchh kam kya krtay thay، hm kahnwn kay pas jaya krtay thay۔\"" as nay jwab dya kh kdhnwn ky zyart nh krw، as nay kha: hm shgwn lya krtay thay۔ as nay jwab dya، \""yh ayk aadmy ka khyal hay، lykn yh aap kw aap kay mqasd say dwr nhyn krna chahyay.\"" as nay kha، ’’hm myn aysay aadmy bhy thay jw zmyn pr lkyryn khynch kr fal nkaltay thay۔‘‘ as nay jwab dya: \""ayk nby tha jw lkyryn khynchta tha، as lyay agr kwyy aysa kray jysa kh as nay kya، tw yh jayz hay۔\"" mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"""""
"4593","aayshh rzy allh anha nay byan kya kh jb rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say kchh lwgwn nay kahnwn kay baray myn pwchha tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”an ka kwyy hsab nhyn۔ wh khnay lgay kh aay khda kay rswl، wh kbhy kbhy aysy bat khh dytay hyn jw sch hw۔ as nay jwab dya kh yh ayk schayy ky bat hay jsay ayk jn apnay dwst kay kan myn mrghywn ky trh chhyn kr phwnk marta hay، phr wh as myn sw say zyadh jhwt mla dytay hyn۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4594","as nay btaya kh as nay khda kay rswl kw yh khtay hwyay sna: \frshtay alanan yany badlwn myn atrtay hyn awr aasman myn ayk amr ka zkr krtay hyn، phr shyatyn chpkay say sntay awr sntay hyn awr kahnwn kw btatay hyn jw as kay sath apnay bnayay hwyay sw jhwt bwltay hyn۔\"" bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"""""
"4595","hfsh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw shkhs ksy aaraf kay pas jayay awr as say ksy chyz kay baray myn swal kray tw chalys dn tk as ky daa qbwl nhyn hwgy۔ * lfzy twr pr، ratyn."
"4596","zyd by۔ khald jhny nay kha: rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay hmyn hdybyh myn sbh ky nmaz prhayy jw rat myn barsh hwyy thy، phr jb fargh hwyay tw lwgwn ky trf mtwjh hwyay awr frmaya: kya tm jantay hw kh tmharay rb nay kya kha hay؟ an kay as jwab pr kh khda awr as ka rswl sb say bhtr jantay thay as nay btaya kh aap nay frmaya tha kh aaj sbh myray bndwn myn say ayk mjh pr ayman lanay wala awr ayk kafr tha، js nay kha kh hmyn khda kay fzl w krm say barsh hwyy hay wh hay jw mjh pr ayman layay awr staray kw nh manay، lykn js nay kha kh flan staray nay mjhay barsh dy awr flan starh ka ankar kya۔ awr staray pr yqyn rkhta hay۔\ (bkhary w mslm)"""""
"4597","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”allh taalyٰ nay aasman say kwyy namt nazl nhyn ky jb tk kh lwgwn ka ayk grwh as ka ankar nh kray، allh taalyٰ barsh nazl krta hay lykn wh khtay hyn kh flan flan staray say aaty hay۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"4598","abn abas rzy allh anhma say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”agr kwyy alm njwm ka alm hasl krta hay tw as nay jadw ky ayk shakh hasl kr ly hay js say asay zyadh hasl hwta hay jb tk kh wh as pr aml krta rhay ga۔ asay ahmd، abwdaod awr abn majh nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4599","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw shkhs ksy kahn ka shara lay awr as ky batwn kw man lay، ya apny bywy say hyz ky halt myn jmaa kray، ya apny bywy say as kay mqad kay zryaay jmaa kray tw as ka as say kwyy talq nhyn jw mhmd pr nazl hwa hay۔ asay ahmd awr abwdaod nay rwayt kya hay۔"
"4600","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb allh taalyٰ aasman pr ksy kam ka fyslh krta hay tw frshtay apnay prwn kw as kay frman kay taba krtay hyn jw hmwar pthr pr znjyr ky trh hwta hay، phr jb an kay dl khwf say aazad hw jatay hyn tw khtay hyn kh tmharay rb nay kya kha hay؟“ awr jwab mlta hay، ”jw as nay kha wh sch hay awr why sb say zyadh snnay wala hay، phr why sb say blnd awr blnd hay“۔ as trh kchh awpr walay (sfyan* apny hthyly say as ky msal dytay hwyay، asay phyrtay hwyay awr anglywn kw alg krtay hwyay) phr ayk as lfz kw sn kr apnay nychay walay kw day dyta hay، awr asy trh jb tk kwyy asay jadwgr ky zban pr nh day day ya as say phlay hy gzr jata hay۔ as say phlay kh wh asay pkray awr as kay sath sw jhwt bwlay lwg pwchhtay hyn kh kya as nay flan dn flan flan nhyn kha tha awr as bat ky wjh say jw aasman say sny gyy thy۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔ *yany sfyan bn ayynh jn kay zryaay rwayt mntql hwyy۔  sy ayf۔ qraan، 15:18"
"4601","abn abas rzy allh anhma khtay hyn kh ansar kay ayk aadmy nay jw rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay sathy thay، mjh say byan kya kh wh ayk rat rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay sath bythay hwyay thay kh ayk starh gra awr chmk atha۔ as nay an say pwchha kh zmanh jahlyt myn jb as nwayt ky kwyy chyz phynky jaty thy tw wh kya khtay thay، tw anhwn nay jwab dya kh khda awr as ka rswl hy bhtr jantay hyn، hm khtay thay kh as rat kwyy bra aadmy pyda hwa tha، ya kwyy bra aadmy fwt hw gya tha۔ phr khda kay rswl nay frmaya kh yh ksy ky mwt ya zndgy ky wjh say nhyn phynka jata lykn jb hmara rb js ka nam mbark hay ksy maamlay ka fyslh krta hay arsh walay as ky tsbyh krtay hyn tw aasman walay as ky tsbyh krtay hyn yhan tk kh tsbyh as nchlay aasman kay rhnay walwn tk phnch jaty hay۔ an kw btao kh as nay kya kha phr aasman walay ayk dwsray say pwchhtay hyn yhan tk kh wh as nchlay aasman tk phnch jata hay phr jnat nay asay apnay dwstwn tk phncha dya awr ab jw kchh wh latay hyn wh sch hay، lykn wh as myn mlawt krtay hyn۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"4602","qtadh nay kha kh khda nay an starwn kw tyn mqasd kay lyay bnaya hay۔ as nay an kw aasman ky zynt bnaya، shytanwn kay lyay myzayl awr nshanyan jn say lwg apna rasth tlash krtay hyn۔ agr kwyy an ky wzaht mkhtlf tryqay say krta hay tw wh ghlty krta hay، jw kchh asay dya gya hay asay zaya krta hay، awr apnay aap kw aysy chyz myn lgata hay js kay baray myn wh nhyn janta۔ bkhary nay asay mkml snd kay bghyr nql kya hay۔ Razln kay wrzhn myn hay، \khwd kw an chyzwn myn mshghwl krta hay js say as ka talq nhyn hay، js ka asay kwyy alm nhyn hay، awr jw anbyaa awr frshtay jannay say qasr hyn۔\"""""""
"4603","rbya ky rwayt myn as kay alawh kchh aysa hy asr hay kh \myn khda ky qsm kha kr khta hwn kh khda nay ksy staray myn ksy ky zndgy، rzq ya mwt nhyn rkhy، wh srf khda pr jhwt bwl rhay hyn awr starwn ky trf asbab mnswb kr rhay hyn۔\"""""""
"4604","abn abas rzy allh anhma say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”js nay starwn ky sayns ka kwyy hsh as mqsd kay lyay hasl kya jw allh nay zkr kya hay tw as nay jadw ky ayk shakh hasl ky hay، njwmy kahn hay، kahn jadwgr hay awr jadwgr kafr hay۔ razn nay asay mntql kya۔"
"4605","abw sayd say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”agr allh taalyٰ apnay bndwn say barsh kw panch sal tk rwk day awr phr bhyj day tw bny nwa ansan ka ayk tbqh kafr hw jayay ga kh anhyn barsh kay staray almjdh* kay zryaay pany frahm kya gya hay۔ nsayy nay asay nql kya hay۔ * dwmkyt ka lfz jr say nkla hay js ka mtlb hlchl krna hay، awr jma an starwn kay amwmy nam kay twr pr astamal hwta hay jn kay baray myn kha jata hay kh wh barsh kw hlatay hyn، yhan jw wahd astamal kya gya hay wh Hyades ka hwalh day skta hay، lykn dwsry wzahtyn bhy dy gyy hyn۔ chwnkh brsat ka mwsm mkhsws awqat say jra hwa tha js myn kchh staray tlwa hwtay thay، as lyay barsh kw an say mnswb kya jata tha۔"
"4606","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw kchh baqy rh gya hay wh mbshrat hay۔ as say pwchha gya kh as ka kya mtlb hay awr kha kh yh ayk achha wzhn hay۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"
"4607","mlk nay 'ata' b kay wrzhn myn shaml kya۔ ysar، \jsay mslman dykhta hay، ya jw asay dkhaya jata hay۔\"""""""
"4608","ans rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”achhy bsart nbwt ka chhyalyswan hsh hay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4609","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: js nay mjhay khwab myn dykha as nay mjhay dykha، kywnkh shytan myry shkl myn zahr nhyn hwta۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4610","abw qtadh rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: js nay mjhay dykha as nay dykha kh asl kya hay۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4611","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jw mjhay khwab myn dykhay ga wh mjhay bydary myn dykhay ga، kywnkh shytan myry msal nhyn rkhta۔ (bkhary w mslm۔) * as rwayt say kchh dshwary hwyy hay۔ yh tjwyz kya jata hay kh agr as say mrad pyghmbr kay zmanay kay lwg hyn jnhwn nay abhy mdynh hjrt nhyn ky hay tw as ka mtlb yh hay kh wh hjrt kr kay whan pyghmbr kw dykhyn gay۔ agr yh bad kay lwgwn ky trf asharh krta hay tw as ka mtlb hay kh wh asay aglay jhan myn dykhyn gay۔"
"4612","abw qtadh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”khda ky trf say achha nzarh awr shytan ky trf say khwab aata hay، lhza jb tm myn say kwyy shkhs jw asay psnd hw asay btayay، awr jb wh napsndydh chyz dykhay tw as kay shr say awr shytan kay shr say pnah mangay، awr as kay bayyn trf tyn bar thwkay، phr asay kwyy nqsan nh phnchayay“۔ (bkhary w mslm)"
"4613","sydna jabr rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb tm myn say kwyy aysa rwya dykhay jw asay napsnd hw tw asay chahyay kh tyn bar apnay bayyn trf thwkay، tyn bar shytan say allh ky pnah mangay، awr js trf wh lyta tha as say pltay۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"4614","hzrt abwhryrh rzy allh anh say mrwy hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ’’jb mwmn ka wqt qryb aata hay tw shayd hy jhwta hw۔ mwmn ky bsart nbwt ka chhyalyswan hsh hay awr jw chyz nbwt say talq rkhty hay wh jhwty nhyn hw skty۔‘‘ mhmd bn syryn nay kha kh an kay nzdyk rwya tyn qsm ky hyn: andr say aanay walay khyalat، shytan ky wjh say khwfnak awr khda ky trf say khwshkhbry، as lyay jb kwyy shkhs napsndydh chyz dykhay tw asay ksy kw btana nhyn chahyay، blkh grdn atha kr daa mangny chahyay۔ nynd myn، lykn yh kh lwg byry say razy hw gyay، jysa kh kha jata hay kh byry، bkhary w mslm kay mzbwt hwnay ky trf asharh krty hay۔"
"4615","bkhary nay kha kh asay qtadh، ywns، hshym awr abw hlal nay abn syryn ky snd say nql kya hay jnhwn nay abwhryrh ky snd nql ky hay۔ ywns nay kha kh an ka khyal hay kh byry kay baray myn jw kchh kha gya hay wh nby sly allh alyh wslm say hay، lykn mslm nay kha kh wh nhyn jantay kh yh rwayt myn hay ya abn syryn nay kha hay۔ ayk nskhh myn bhy kchh aysa hy asr hay، awr rwayt myn aakhr tk alfaz \as nay grdn pr twq dykhna napsnd kya...\"" dakhl kya gya hay۔"""""
"4616","jabr rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh ayk aadmy nby krym sly allh alyh wslm kay pas aaya awr kha: khwab myn mjhay aysa lga kh kwyy sr kta hwa hay۔ rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm hnsay awr frmaya: ”jb shytan tm myn say ksy kw khwab myn khylay tw wh lwgwn kw as kay baray myn nh btayay۔ mslm nay asay mntql kya۔"
"4617","ans rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”ayk rat mjhay khwab myn aysa malwm hwa kh myn aqbh bn rafa kay ghr myn hwn awr abn tb* ky kchh tazh khjwryn lay kr aayy hwn، myn nay as ky tabyr yh ky kh hmyn dnya myn azt (rfaa) dy gyy hay، aakhrt myn babrkt (albaas) jw hmaray dyn myn achha hay (albas)۔ asay mntql kya. *jbkh baz ka khyal hay kh abn tab ayk aadmy tha jw ya tw shra myn rhta tha ya mdynh myn js kay pas khjwryn thyn، lykn as ky shyh wzaht zyadh mmkn hay kh yh mdynh ky khjwrwn ky ayk qsm ka nam hay nh kh ksy aadmy ka۔  an namwn kay hswn kay bnyady many say ayk achha shgwn lya jata hay۔"
"4618","abw mwsyٰ rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: myn nay khwab myn dykha kh myn mkh say khjwr kay drkhtwn waly srzmyn ky trf hjrt kr rha hwn awr myn nay gman kya kh yh ymamh ya hjr ky trf hay، lykn yh ysrb ka shhr hay، myn nay apnay as khwab myn dykha kh myn nay tlwar chlayy awr as ka agla hsh kat dya gya، yh an lwgwn kay mannay walwn ky nmayndgy kr rhay thay jw jng myn shaml thay۔ asay dwbarh nshan zd kya gya awr asay mkml halt myn bhal kr dya gya؛ awr yh as fth awr mwmnyn ky jmaat ky nmayndgy krta hay jw khda nay laya hay۔\ (bkhary w mslm) * mdynh ka prana nam  ghalbaً fth mkh awr aslam qbwl krnay walwn ky tadad ka hwalh۔ sy ayf qraan، 110"""""
"4619","abwhryrh rzy allh anh say rwayt hay kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm nay frmaya: ”jb myn sw rha tha tw myray pas zmyn kay khzanay layay gyay awr swnay kay dw kngn jw myray hath myn rkhay hwyay thay، mjh pr twlay gyay، phr mjh pr why nazl hwyy kh myn an pr phwnk marwn، awr jb myn nay aysa kya tw wh chlay gyay، myn nay an kw dw jhwtwn ky nmayndgy krtay hwyay tabyr kya، jw myn ayk jgh myn ayk jhwta tha۔ al ymamh۔\ (bkhary w mslm۔) ayk rwayt myn kha gya hay kh an myn say ayk msylmh tha، jw ymamh ka aadmy tha، awr dwsra alansy،  snaaa ka aadmy tha۔ mjhay (mtrjm kw) yh nskhh dw shyhwn myn nhyn mla، lykn jama kay msnf nay asay trmzy ky snd say zkr kya hay۔ * as nay apnay aap kw nby kay twr pr khra kya۔  alaswd alansy js nay almhajr pr hmlh kya۔ abw amyh bn almghyrh، rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm kay ayjnt nay sdqat jma krnay kay lyay snaaa bhyja tha۔ as nay jnwb myn kafy bghawt ky۔"""""
"4620","am alalaa alansaryh rzy allh anha nay kha kh jb wh sw rhy thyn tw anhwn nay asman rzy allh anh ka ayk chshmh dykha۔ mzawn bhh gya، awr jb as nay khda kay rswl kw btaya tw as nay jwab dya: \yh as kay achhay aamal ky nmayndgy krta hay* jw as kay lyay mslsl brh rhay hyn۔\"" bkhary nay asay nql kya۔ *asman ghzwh bdr kay bad fwt hwchkay thay، lykn as qwl kw as trh lya jata hay kh an ky nykyan ab bhy brh rhy thyn۔ kha jata hay kh as ka mtlb an ka ajr hay۔ sy ayf mrqat، chharm، 545۔"""""
"4621","smwra by۔ jndb rzy allh anh khtay hyn kh jb nby sly allh alyh wslm nay nmaz prhy tw aap sly allh alyh wslm nay hmary trf mnh kr kay pwchha: tm myn say kl rat ks nay rwya hay؟ agr hm myn say ksy kay pas hwta tw as nay asay btaya awr wh as ky tabyr jysa kh khda chahta۔ ayk dn as nay hm say pwchha kh kya tm myn say ksy nay rwya dykhy hay؟ awr jb hm nay jwab dya kh hm nay aysa nhyn kya tw as nay kha: \lykn kl rat myn nay dw aadmywn kw dykha jw myray pas aayay، myra hath pkr kr mjhay ayk mqds srzmyn pr lay gyay، myn nay dykha kh ayk aadmy bytha hay awr ayk aadmy khra hay js kay hath myn lwhay ka ayk tkra hay jsay wh dwsray aadmy kay jbray myn dal rha hay awr asay as ky grdn kay pchhlay hsay tk phyr rha hay، awr phr jbray kw dwbarh lpytnay lga۔ myn nay phr pwchha kh yh kya hay awr anhwn nay mjhay kha kh hm ayk aysay shkhs kay pas phnchay jw apny pyth pr pra hwa tha js kay awpr ayk aadmy apnay hath kay brabr pthr lay kr khra tha js say wh as kay sr pr mara tw wh as kay pychhay chla gya awr wh as ky halt pr waps nhyn aaya awr myn nay as say pwchha kh yh kya hay awr anhwn nay mjhay kha kh hm ayk tndwr ky trh hyn، js kay nychay aag lgy hwyy thy jb tk kh wh bahr nkl gyay، lykn jb wh nychay aaya tw hm nay kha kh myn nay kya kya؟ js kay knaray pr ayk aadmy khra tha js kay samnay drya myn mwjwd shkhs nay bahr nklna chaha awr as kay mnh myn pthr dal kr asay waps bhyj dya jhan say wh bahr nklnay ky kwshsh krta tha awr as nay mjh say pwchha kh yh khan say aaya hay۔ chnanchh hm aagay brhay yhan tk kh ayk sbz bagh myn phnchay js kay damn myn ayk bra drkht tha js kay damn myn ayk bwrha aadmy awr kchh lrkay thay awr as kay qryb ayk aadmy tha js kay samnay aag thy jsay wh jla rha tha۔ myray dw sathy mjhay drkht pr lay gyay awr drkht kay bych myn ayk ghr myn lay aayay jw myn nay dykha tha kh as say zyadh khwbswrt bwrhay، jwan، awrtyn awr lrkay thay۔ phr anhwn nay mjhay whan say nkal kr drkht pr chrhaya awr ayk khwbswrt awr bhtryn ghr myn lay gyay js myn bwrhay awr jwan thay۔ yh btatay hwyay kh wh aaj rat mjhay lay gyay hyn، myn nay an say kha kh myn nay jw kchh dykha hay as kay baray myn mjhay btayyn، js pr wh razy hw gyay۔ anhwn nay kha kh myn nay js aadmy kw apnay jbray myn lwng krtay dykha tha wh jhwta tha js nay jhwt bwla tha jw as say mnqwl hwa awr asay zmyn kay knarwn tk phnchaya gya tw myn nay jw kchh dykha wh qyamt tk as kay sath hwga۔ wh shkhs js kay sr pr myn nay ghwnsa dykha tha wh wh aadmy tha jsay allh taalyٰ nay qraan prhaya tha lykn wh rat kw swta tha awr as say ghflt brtta tha awr dn myn as ky talymat kay mtabq aml nhyn krta tha، as lyay jw kchh myn nay dykha wh qyamt tk as kay sath hwta rhay ga۔ jn kw myn nay swrakh myn dykha tha wh zany thay awr jsay myn nay drya myn dykha tha wh swd khatay thay۔ myn nay drkht kay damn myn js bwrhay kw dykha tha wh abrahym tha، as kay ardgrd lrkay aadmywn kay bchay thay awr aag jlanay wala malk jhnm ka mhafz tha۔ phla ghr js myn myn dakhl hwa wh aam mwmnyn ka mskn tha lykn yh ghr shhdaa ka mskn tha۔ an myn say ayk nay mjhay btaya kh wh jbrayyl hyn awr dwsray mykayyl nay mjhay kha kh apna sr athao، awr jb myn nay aysa kya tw myn nay sfyd badl ky trh kchh dykha (ayk wrzhn jw kmwls badl dyta hay) awr anhwn nay mjhay btaya kh yh myra thkanh hwga۔ myn nay an say kha kh mjhay apny rhaysh gah myn dakhl hwnay dyn lykn anhwn nay mjhay btaya kh myray pas rhnay kay lyay abhy kchh wqt baqy hay jw myn nay pwra nhyn kya hay awr agr myn asay mkml kr lyta tw myn apnay ghr myn dakhl hw jata۔ bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"""""
"4622","abw rzyn alaqyly nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say rwayt ky hay kh aap nay frmaya: ”mwmn ky bsart nbwt ka chhyalyswan hsh hay، yh aadmy pr tb tk phrphraty rhty hay jb tk kh wh as kay baray myn bat nhyn krta، lykn jb wh as kay baray myn bat krta hay tw wh thyk hw jata hay۔ awr mjhay lgta hay kh as nay kha، \srf ksy dwst say bat kryn ya shyh fyslay kay sath۔\"" asay trmzy nay nql kya hay۔ abwdaod ky rwayt myn hay kh bsart aadmy pr tb tk phrphraty rhty hay jb tk as ky tshryh nh ky jayay lykn jb as ky tshryh ky jayay tw wh thhr jaty hay۔ awr mjhay lgta hay kh as nay kha، \""yh srf as kw btao jw as say mhbt krta hay ya asay jw fyslh krta hay۔\"""""""
"4623","aayshh rzy allh anha nay byan kya kh rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say wrqh kay baray myn swal kya gya tw khdyjh rzy allh anha nay an say kha: \wh aap pr ayman layay thay، lykn aap kay zhwr say phlay hy fwt hw gyay thay۔\"" khda kay rswl nay phr frmaya: \""mjhay khwab myn dykha gya kh wh sfyd kpray phnay hwyay hyn، awr agr wh jhnm kay bashndwn myn say hwta tw mkhtlf lbas phnay hwtay۔\"" asay ahmd awr trmzy nay rwayt kya hay۔"""""
