"4625","smwra by۔ jndb nay btaya kh khda kay rswl nay aksr apnay sathywn say jw batyn pwchhy thyn an myn say ayk yh thy kh \kya tm myn say ksy nay khwab dykha hay؟\"" phr js say khda chahta asay bta dyta۔ ayk sbh as nay an say kha، \""pchhly rat dw lwg myray pas aayay awr mjhay jhnjhwr kr kha kh chlw tw myn bhy an kay sath nkla۔\"" as nay twalt myn phlay hsay myn mzkwr rwayt say mlta jlta zkr kya، lykn as myn yh azafh hay jw mzkwrh rwayt myn nhyn hay: \""hm ayk prtaysh bagh myn phnchay js myn hr qsm kay bhar kay phwl thay، js kay bych myn ayk aadmy tha jw atna lmba tha kh myn as ka sr nhyn dykh skta tha، atna awncha wh aasman ky trf chla gya؛ awr myn nay as aadmy kay ardgrd as say zyadh bchay dykhay jw myn nay pwchha kh as say zyadh bchay kwn hyn؟ lykn anhwn nay mjhay janay kw kha tw hm ayk aysay bray bagh myn phnchay js say bra ya zyadh khwbswrt kbhy nhyn dykha tha، awr jb hm aysa kr chkay tw hm swnay awr chandy ky ayntwn say bnay hwyay shhr kay pas phnchay kh asay khwl dya jayay، awr jb yh hwa tw hm sb say zyadh aadhay aadmywn ky trh nzr aayay۔ bdswrt aap dykh sktay hyn kh ayk drya tha js myn khals dwdh ky trh sfyd pany bhta tha، awr myray sathywn nay an say kha kh wh as drya myn dwb jayyn awr wh bdswrty dwr kr kay hmaray pas waps aayay۔ as azafay ky wzaht myn as nay zkr kya kh bagh myn jw lmba qd aadmy tha wh abrahym tha awr as kay ardgrd jw bchay thay wh sb kay sb wh thay jw schay dyn ky pyrwy krtay hwyay pyda hwyay thay awr fwt hwyay thay۔ kchh mslmanwn nay rswl allh sly allh alyh wslm say mshrkyn kay bchwn kay baray myn pwchha tw aap nay jwab dya kh wh bhy whan mwjwd hyn۔ as nay jary rkha: \""wh lwg jw aadhay khwbswrt awr aadhay bdswrt thay wh lwg thay jnhwn nay ayk achhay kam kw dwsray bray kay sath mlaya tha awr khda nay asay maaf kr dya tha۔\"" bkhary nay asay nql kya۔"""""
